<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Satawalese</book>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Mark</para>
  <para style="mt">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Mark</para>
  <para style="rem">Book introduction has been temporarily moved to the XXA book. Later it can be placed back here. (Paulus Kieviet, January 2019)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen John Baptist Fenai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luke 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">John 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ieei iiy Kkepas Mwamwaai we iwe kkepesaen Jesus Kristus iwe Naiun Deus. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Erhaepetae reen miniwe profeta Isaiah a foatogitiw pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Deus a kkepas, ‘Ngaang ipwene fang tiw naeyi rhooan pweipwogin kkepas me weni mmwoamw pwe epwe noa maeneti ennepoamw.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Erhai a iyaekkepwas me noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Oawpwe oamoannatae ennepaen Soamwoon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">oawpwe awenecchera eew aan epwe faaeraeg wooan.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>John a no noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we, a paptismus me epwan fenai. A aengaeniir aeremas kkewe pwe, “Oawpwe toagun saengi monofitimi nge oawwa paptismus. Ina nge, Deus epwe saeneti noa aaemi monofit.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Rhooanap we re itto saengi faniuwaen Judea me taeninimwen Jerusalem ra noa reen John. Ra pwuwafayiuw noa aar monofit, nge John a paptismusaar noan pwupwu we Jordan.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>John e memmengaag mengaag effeeor saengi iunaen <char style="tl">camel</char>, nge pwaanto na aan effeeor saengi ginin maan, nge anan mwongo ina manni neeiin waniwan ina nirhiugiunpweon me <char style="tl">honey</char>. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Iwe, a aengaeniir aeremas pwe, “Mwaaen ee epwe wareto me mwiriy ina e taegias saengiaei, ngaang mwo nge ese fin ipwe ppwoarotiw pwe ipwe pwaeisi geeogeeon nokkaan. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Ngaang i paptismus aeginigaemi reen rhaan, nge iiy epwe paptismus aeginigaemi reen Espritu Santus.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aan Paptismus me Aan Sessoat Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(Mat 3.13 — 4.11; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luke 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Ese pwongiy noa mwo nge Jesus a itto me Nazareth noan Galilee pwe epwe paptismus reen John noan rhan pwupwu we Jordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Igiwe rhag Jesus a teeotae me noan rhan we, a weri pwe a susu noa naaeng, iwe nge Espritu santus a ittiw wooan nge eweei rhag erhai <char style="tl">dove</char>. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Iwe nge eew mangiungiu a ittiw me naaeng a aepesa pwe, “Een naeyi mwaaen aerhaengerhaeng, iye efin tipaei reen.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Iwe rhag nge Espritu Santus a fangenoa Jesus noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>A no igiwe noan iugiugiun faaeig raaen nge Saetan a aegina aan soatoni. Iwe a no neeiir maan mwoarho, iwe nge angkenus ra itto tipaengi.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingiir Faaman Rhooan Fita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luke 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Mwirin aaen John toonong noan kanepwus, Jesus a noa Galilee a noa fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we e itto me reen Deus. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>A aepesa pwe, “A itto oatowe, Mweoiun Deus a arapeto. Oawpwe toagun saengi aaemi monofit nge oawwa niugiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai een.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Igiwe Jesus a faaeraeg oaroi meoneoiniuniun Galilee nge a weriir riiurhai pwipwi, Simon me Andrew, iir rhooan fita, rewuug fetaen noan meoneoiniun we. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Iwe, Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw itto tapweaei pwe ipwe kapwiung ngaenigaemi wunuunun aaemi oawpwe fita aeremas.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Iwe rhag nge ra siusaengi wuug kkewe aar nge ra tapweei noa mwirin Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Ese pwan taaw noa aan faaeraeg nge a pwan weriir riiurhai pwipwi, James me John, ikkiwe naiun Zebedee. Reno wooan pwoot we waar nge refeeori naiiur wuug. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Nge igiwe rhag Jesus a giuneer, a faingiir. Ra siusaengi Zebedee we semeer wooan pwoot we waar me rhooan engaang kkewe nge ra tapweei noa mwirin Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erhai Mwaaen Ewartae Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luke 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra toori taeninimwen Capernaum. Nge igiwe a toori raaenin Sabbath, Jesus a toonong noan eew wutteer Jews nge a rhaepetae aan fenai. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Iir aeremas kkewe re rongorong ra riutae reen aan fenai, pwe aan fenai ese weei taeppen aar fenai sinsein anniug kkewe, pwe a taeppen erhai eyor maemaewan.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Reen rhag oatowe erhai mwaaen a yor erhai aniu aenneew wooan a toonong noan wutteer Jews we nge a itinong aekkepwas, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Meeta oamw mwerhaen ngaenigemaem, Jesus re Nazareth? Wa itto pwe wopwe oatoaropagemaem? Ngaang i giuneei een iyo: een mwaaenessoar we rhooan pweipwogin kkepas we aaen Deus!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Iwe, Jesus a anniugiu ngaeni aniuwe pwe, “Wopwe anniug noa nge wa siunoa me wooan mwaaen na.”<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Iwe nge iiy aniu aenneew we a feeori mwaaen we pwe epwe ngoong fetaen, nge a aekkepwas nge a tiwtiw me wooan. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Iwe aeremas towunap ra riutae nge ra rhaepetae aar kkepas nee fineer, “Meeta eei? Pwan eew taeppen fenai ffeo minneei? Mwaaen een eyor maemaewan pwe e iura rhag eew nge aniu aenneew re tapweei.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Iwe miniwe kkepesaen Jesus a rheeoi mwetekkaei noa wooan Galilee.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Towunepaen Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luke 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Mwirin, Jesus me James me John me rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa saengi wutteer Jews we nge ra noa noan imwaen Simon me Andrew. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Iwe niewe inaen pwiuniuwaen Simon e wonon semwaai reen pwerhikkeraen ginin. Etonong rhag Jesus nge ra aengaeni wunuunun niewe. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Iwe, Jesus a toonong reen, a ammwarhiu paiun nge a tipaengitae. Iwe, a saer noa pwerhin niewe iwe a ittae engaang ngaeniir.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Mwirin tupwunoan aenet pwe a nee oatofaaef noa, aeremas ra pweipwog to rhooa semwaai reen Jesus, pwan rhooawe eyor aniu aenneew wooar. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Iwe oanongeer rhooan aepinoamw we ra itto mweoiu noa mesaen iimw we. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Iwe Jesus a aecchipwaar tae towunepeer rhooa semwaai kkewe saengi mesemesaen aar semwaai. A asiiur noa towunepaen aniu aenneew, nge ese fang ngaeniir mwo nge epat pwe repwe aepesa, pwe ra fasiun giuneei iiy iyo.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Fenai Noan Galilee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luke 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Weni mmwaei raaenin we eraaen, igiwe aenet esaaen teeotae, Jesus a mmasetae nge a toowow me reen iimw we. A noa eew pwiuneoi ne iiy noa rhag nge a noa maeipin e. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Nge Simon me rhooawe rhinan ra noa giutta Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Oatowe ra weri, ra aengaeni pwe, “Oanongeer aeremas ra giuttoag.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw sipwe pwan noa noan aekkaew soapw, pwe ipwe noa fenai e, pwe ina faan aaei itto.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Iwe a noa noan oanongaen Galilee, a noa fenai noan wutteer Jews we nge a asiiur wow aniu aenneew.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Maemerhoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luke 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Iwe, erhai mwaaen kaenepaai a itto reen Jesus, a foatotiw me mmwan nge a aeffaenipirhe ngaeni pwe epwe tipaengi. A aepesa pwe, “Aere wo mwerhaen, wa aecchipwanoa aaei semwaai.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Iwe Jesus a igin faayeow, e angenoa nge a geotteopa mwaaen we, nge a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ngaang i mwerhaen, wone cchipw noa!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Reen rhag oatowe nge kaenepaai we a rhiuw saengi mwaaen we, iwe a nimegacch noa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Mwirin, Jesus a igin feneow mwaaen we nge a mwetekkaein aefenganoa, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>moannon aan aengaeni pwe, “Pipiiy, wosoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai minneei, nge wa faaeraeg uwen noa reen patere pwe epwe weriug. Iwe nge a feeori oasoar we Moses e akkiuneo, pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir aeremas pwe wa nimegacch noa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Nge mwaaen we a noa nge a noa aepesa faaeraegiy wunuunun miniwe a wen ngaeni. Ina faaen Jesus esa mmwenen noa no fenai noan taeninimw kkewe reen. Nge a noa rhag no noan pwiuneoi ne iiy noa rhag. Iwe, aeremas saengi oanongaen pwiuneoi ra itto reen.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Maemerhoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luke 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Fitowu noa raaen me mwirin nge Jesus a sefaaeniti Capernaum, iwe nge kkepas we a rheeoi noa pwe a no nee iimw. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Iwe a igin towunap aeremas maegeto, iwe esa rhiuwen yor no neniy. Pwan paen asam we mwo nge epwan sseog noa. Iwe nge Jesus a fenai ngaeniir. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Faaman mwaaen ra pwigito reen, erhai mwaaen e maemerhoar.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00305B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="Mark 2.3"/> <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Nge pwonno igiwe ra igin towunap aeremas esa mmwen no pwe repwe pwigito mwaaen we reen Jesus. Iwe ra ngetaeni wooan oason iimw we wenewenen igiwe Jesus eno ee. Iwe ra atairaetiw mwaaen maemerhoar we ewon noan giegiy. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Igiwe Jesus a weri nepaen aar niugiuniug, a aengaeni mwaaen we e maemerhoar pwe, “Naeyi, monofitimw a mwusunoa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Nge aaemweoi sinsein anniug kkewe remooat igiwe ra niuwaennei nong nee tipeer pwe, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Meeta mwaaeneei a ieei wunuunun aan kkepas reen? Pwe ina nge a aepesa aenneewa Deus. Deus rhag minne emmwen epwe oamwusa noa monofit!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Reen rhag oatowe nge Jesus a giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar, iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oaw niuwaennei minikkena e aenneew reen? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Ifa minna e mererhaeg, aaei ipwe aengaeni mwaaen ee e maemerhoar pwe, ‘Monofitimw a mwusunoa,’ aere aaei ipwe aengaeni pwe, ‘Wopwe iutae, pwigi giemw nge wa faaeraeg noa?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Ngaang ipwe pwaeri ngaenigaemi, pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas eyor maemaewan wooan soanop pwe epwe oamwusa noa monofit.” Iwe a aengaeni mwaaen maemerhoar pwe, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Ipwe aengaeniug, iutae, pwigi giemw nge wa noa noan imwoamw.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Igiwe oanongeer nge re maegin emwaamw, mwaaen we a iutae, a pwigi gien iwe a noa. Iwe ra igin riutae reen feoffeeor we, nge ra aepingepinga Deus, nge ra aepesa pwe, “Esaaen yor mwo aemaem giuneei taeppen minneei.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingi Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luke 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Iwe Jesus a sefaaeniti miniwe meoneoiniuniun Galilee. Iwe aeremas towunap ra maegeto reen, iwe, a rhaepetae aan fenai ngaeniir. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Nge igiwe a feffaaeraeg noa, a weri Levi iwe naiun Alphaeus, erhai rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char>, emooat noan aan <char style="tl">office</char>. Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Itto tapweaei.” Iwe Levi a iutae nge a tapweei noa mwirin.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Mwirin noa nge Jesus a noa mwongo noan imwaen Levi. Towunepaen rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit ra ttapw noa mwirin Jesus. Iwe towunepeer ra mwongo reen Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun reen <char style="tl">table</char> we. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Iwe aaemweoi sinsein anniug, iwe iir pwan Pharisees, ra giuneei pwe Jesus me rhooa monofit kkewe me rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> ra mwongo fengaen, iwe ra aeiineeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Meeta faan naimi sinsei a mwongo ngaeniir rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit kena reen?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Jesus a rongorong aar kkepas nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Rhooakka rese semwaai rese noa reer toagota, pwe rhooakka refaer semwaai. Ngaang ise itto pwe ipwe faingiir rhooa mwamwaai, pwe faer rhooa monofit.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Aecchigipin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luke 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Reen eew oat nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun John Baptist me Pharisees kkewe ra aecchigipin. Iwe, aaemweoi aeremas ra itto reen Jesus ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta naiun John rhooan kkayeo me naiiur Pharisees rhooan kkayeo ra aecchigipin, nge rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw rese aecchigipin reen?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw niuwaennei pwe rhooa itto ngaeni gupwunon appwiuniupai eei repwe aecchigipin? Aapw, pwe iga <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> een eno reer nge resoapw aecchigipin. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Nge epwe itto raaenin na repwe pwigi saengiir <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we, nge ina oatona repwene aecchigipin noa.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Esooar erhai epwe aeyae mengaag ffeo aan epwe pinisa tae wooan erheo mengaag maerhiy, nge aere epwe feeori taeppen eei, iwe mengaag ffeo we epwe fereei noa mengaag maerhiy we, nge miniwe taeringen epwene faer gin temoag noa. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Esooar erhai epwe aenianong <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy, pwe <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo we epwe taeringatiw nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy we, iwe <char style="tl">wine</char> we epwe niytiw ne ppweon. Ina minne <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo epwe pwan aekikki nong rhag noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Sabbath</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luke 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Jesus e feffaaeraeg noa noan aekkaew maetaen <char style="tl">wheat</char> wooan raaenin Sabbath. Nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra rhaepetae ne ferhiy iuwoapwon <char style="tl">wheat</char> kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Iwe Pharisees kkewe ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Pipiiy, ese gacch ngaeni aarh anniug pwe rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw repwe feeori minna wooan raaenin Sabbath!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawsaaen aeraegi meeta we David efeeori noan oaton we e tipaeni epwe mwongo? Iiy me rhooawe rhoaniuwan ra igin pecchai, <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>iwe a toonong noan imwaen Deus a itinong angi fenoawa kkewe ra aeni oasoar ngaeni Deus. Minneen ewen reen oatowe Abiathar minne Soamwoonin Patere. Noan aarh anniug nge rhooawe patere rhag minne repwe mmwenen angi — nge David e angi nge a pwan ngaenneer mwaaen kkewe rhoaniuwan.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Iwe Jesus a soapwei noa pwe, “Sabbath effeeor pwe faan ngaeniir aeremas, nge aeremas rese ffeeor pwe faan ngaeni Sabbath. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Iwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas ina pwan iiy Soamwoonin Sabbath.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Erhai Mwaaen e Maemerhoar Paiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luke 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Iwe Jesus a sefaaeniti wutteer Jews we, eno erhai mwaaen e maemerhoar paiun ee. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Iwe nge aaemweoi aeremas ra pwan no igiwe, pwe re giutta aekkaew rhaepin minikka repwe oaturu Jesus wooan; ina faan ra pipiiy gacchiuw Jesus aere epwe aecchipwa mwaaen we wooan raaenin Sabbath we. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Iwe, Jesus a aengaeni mwaaen we e maemerhoar paiun pwe, “Itto weni mmweer aeremas kaan.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Iwe a aeiineeor aeremas kkewe pwe, “Meeta aarh anniug e aengaenigirh sipwe mmwenen feeori noan raaenin Sabbath? Sipwe tipaengiir, aere sipwe oawoasuur? Sipwe aemenewa erhai, aere sipwe niiy noa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Nge iir ra anniug noa rhag. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Jesus a igin soong igiwe e wegitaeg fetaen wooar, nge pwan reen oatowe rhag nge a pwan igin faayeeor, pwe igiwe e cchemaw nee tipeer nge ese pwiung reer. Iwe a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Aeitiwow poawumw.” Iwe a aeitiwow paiun, iwe a mamaaw sefaaen. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Iwe Pharisees kkewe ra siusaengi wutteer Jews we nge ra noa rhu fengaen me aaemweoi rhinaen Erotes, iwe ra noa pwiungiuw wunuunun aar repwe niiy noa Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Pwuwa me Oaroi Meoneoiniun we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa ppaei meoneoiniuniun Galilee, nge eew pwuwaen aeremas a ttapw noa mwiriir. Ra itto saengi Galilee me Judea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>me Jerusalem, me Idumea, me eew faniuwaen eotiwen Jordan me ikkiwe faniuwaen oaron taeninimwen Tyre me Sidon. Oanongeer aeremas kaan nge ra itto reen Jesus, pwe re rongorong meeta kkewe efeeori. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Reen aan igin towunap aeremas, iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe oamoannatae efoarh pwoot faaen itan, pwe aeremas kkewe rete aepettanoa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>A aecchipwaar tae pwuwaen aeremas, nge rhooawe re semwaai ra pwan aetietiy rhag pwe repwe geotteopa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Nge igiwe aeremas kkewe eyor aniu aenneew wooar ra weri Jesus, nge ra gaen ppiungtiw me mmwan nge ra aepwesaegini pwe, “Een Naiun Deus!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nge Jesus a kkepas sseor ngaeniir aniu aenneew kkewe pwe resoapw pwaeri ngaeni mwo nge erhai aere iiy iyo.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Finiir Seig me Riiurhai Oapostonus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luke 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Iwe Jesus a faaeraeg tae wooan eew rhug nge a faingiir to mwaaen kkewe iiy e tipaeniir. Iwe ra itto reen, <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>nge a finiir seig me riiurhai, ikkiwe a pwan aeita ngaeniir pwe oapostonus. A aengaeniir pwe, “Iya finigaemi pwe oawpwe no reei, ipwene aefengaegaemi noa pwe oawpwe noa fenai, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>nge epwe pwan yor maemaewaemi pwe oawpwe asiiur wow aniu aenneew.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Ikkaan iir rhooawe seig me riiurhai a finiir tae: Simon, (Jesus a aeita ngaeni pwe Peter,) <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>James me John iwe re pwipwi, iir naiun Zebedee, (Jesus a aeita ngaeniir “Boanerges” wewen nge “Mwaaenin Pacch”), <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, James naiun Alphaeus, Thaddaeus, Simon, iwe erhai man menat,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">man menat: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">erhai mwaaen e fiiow ngaeniir sonotawaen Rome faaen itaen faniuwan.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>me Judas Iscariot, iwe e fangenoa tinnimaen Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luke 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Iwe Jesus a sefaaen noa nee iimw. Iwe pwuwaen aeremas kkewe repwan sefaaeneto, nge ra igin aetietiy aeremas iwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun resa taween mwongo no. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Igiwe rhooawe aeremesan ra rongorong miniwe, ra noa pwe repwe noa aemmwena, pwe aeremas ra aepesa pwe, “A pwurhunoa!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Iwe aaemweoi sinsein anniug re itto saengi Jerusalem ra aepesa pwe, “A wartae aniuwe Beelzebul wooan. Soamwoonin aniu aenneew minne efang maemaewan pwe epwe asiiur noa aniu aenneew.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Iwe Jesus a faingiir to reen nge a fioang ngaeniir noan fioangon awewe: “Ifa wusun Saetan epwe pwan asiuw noa Saetan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Aere eew faniuw a ginigin fesaeng nge ra fiiow fengaen, faniuw een epwe toarop noa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Aere eew famini e ginigin fesaeng nge regaen fiiow fengaen, famini een epwe toarop noa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Iwe aere mweoiun Saetan a ginigin fesaeng, esoapw tongaeni ssiunaei noa, nge epwe ffeir noa aere rhiuw noa.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>“Esooar erhai epwe tongaeni toonong noan imwaen erhai mwaaen mamaaw pwe epwe pwigi noa pisaegin; aere epwe mmwaen geoni noa mwo mwaaen we, ina nge epwapw mmwenen piraf me noan iimw we.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe oanongaen monofitiir aeremas epwe mmwenen mwusunoa, pwan kkepas aenneew kkewe re aepesa. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Nge aere erhai e aepesa aenneewa Espritu Santus, esoapw tongaeni mwusunoa, pwe a feeori eew monofit kkewe esooar iaenin.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>(Jesus a aepesa taeppen kkepas kkeei pwe iga aaemweoi aeremas ra aepesa pwe, “Erhai aniu aenneew a no wooan.”)<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inaen Jesus me Rhooawe Pwiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luke 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Iwe rhooawe inaen Jesus me pwiin ra wareto. Ra iu niugiun iimw we nge ra tengaeg nong pwe epwe itiwow. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Iwe rhooanap we oaron Jesus ra aengaeni pwe, “Pipiiy, inoamw me rhooawe pwiimw me rhooapwutomw ra no niugiun, nge ra mwerhaen rhuungiug.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Iyo inaei me iyo pwiiy?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>A wegitaeg ngaeniir aeremas kkewe remooat oaron nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw wonoa, ikkaan iir inaei me pwiiy! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Pwe iyo na a feeori nee tipaen Deus, nge iiy pwiiy, me mwengeaei me inaei.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Erhai Rhooan Aeperes Faiun Foat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luke 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Iwe Jesus a rhaepiy sefaaeniy aan fenai oaron meoneoiniuniun Galilee. Iwe nge pwuwaen aeremas ra itto roangei noa oaron, nge iiy a teeotae wooan efoarh pwoot a ittae mooat wooan. Iwe pwoot we a no noan nooamw we, nge rhooa towunap we ra no ngaerhei nooamw we. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>A fioang awewe ngaeniir towunepaen aegiaeg, iwe a aengaeniir pwe:<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Oaw aiussaening! Erhai mwaaen a noa pwe epwe noa aeperes faiun foat. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Igiwe e aeperes fetaen foat kkewe, nge aekkaefai faiun foat ra ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan we, nge man aeniaen ra itto anginoa. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw wooan kaenefai, igiwe ese maniueon ppweon ee. Aekkaaemweoi ra mwetekkaein pwaechetae, pwe igiwe rese no ppweon ttonoa. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Nge enoa ttinitae aenet nge a aeppwesa noa foat kkewe, pwe igiwe ese ttonoa waeran nee ppweon, iwe a mwetekkaein mae noa. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan. Iwe irae towfanfan kkewe ra menawtae nge ra fittitae wooar iwe resa mmwenen uuwa no. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Nge aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw noan ppweon mwamwaai we, iwe ra pwaechetae nge ra uuwa. Aekkaefai neeiir ra uwaeni eniig, aekkaefai woneig, nge aekkaefai epwiugiuw.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Iwe Jesus a aepesa pwe, “Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaen Aaen Jesus Kkepesaen Fioangon Awewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luke 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Igiwe Jesus a iiy noa rhag, rhooawe re tapweei me rhooawe seig me riiurhai ra itto reen nge ra tingoar ngaeni, pwe epwe aweweei ngaeniir faaen fioang kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Deus a fang ngaenigaemi pwe oawpwe giuneei kkepas mwoanomwoanon minna Mweoiun Deus. Nge aaemweoi me niugiunoan repwe rongorong rhag oanongan noan fioangon awewe,<verse eid="MRK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>pwe minni, ‘repwe pipiiy me pipiiy nge resoapw weri;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">repwe aiussaening me aiussaening nge resoapw metaf.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Pwe ngaere re metaf, nge repwe toagun ngaeni Deus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">pwe iiy epwe oamwusaar noa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aemmetefa Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Foat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luke 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Iwe Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Oawse metefaaegini fioangon awewe een? Aere oawse metefaaegini ieei, nge epwe ifa wusun aaemi oawpwe metefaaegini fioangon awewe kka aekkaew? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Rhooan foat we a aeperessa kkepesaen Deus. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra aeffitaeg ngaeni faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan; oate ra rongorong kkepesaen Deus, Saetan a mwetekkaein itto pwigi saengiir. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Aaemweoi re aeffitaeg ngaeni faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wooan kaenefai. Iga ra rongorong miniwe kkepesaen Deus, ra aetiwa noan aar kker. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Nge kkepas we ese waaraar me nee tipeer, iwe ese ssiunaei wooar. Pwe nipwaen a yor fitigogo me waeiraes faaen itaen miniwe kkepesaen Deus, ra mwetekkaein fangetae. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra aeffitaeg ngaeni faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan kkewe. Ikkaan iir rhooa kkewe re rongorong miniwe kkepesaen Deus, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>nge aiunaeng reen menaw e igina me mwecheniaen senaapiy me mesemesaen aegiaeg ra toonong noan nee tipeer ra oamoapwu miniwe kkepesaen Deus, pwe esoapw mmwenen uuwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Nge aaemweoi aeremas re aeffitaeg ngaeni faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wooan ppweon mwamwaai. Re rongorong miniwe kkepesaen Deus, ra aetiwa iwe a uuwa. Aaemweoi ra uwaeni eniig, aaemweoi woneig, nge aaemweoi epwiugiuw.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Oappwun me Faei Saepiy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luke 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Iwe, Jesus a soapwei noa aan fenai, “Meeta, eyor erhai ne epwe pwigito eew oappwun nge a iseni nong faaen eew saepiy aere faaen eew pooa? Nge saapw wooan nenien foaton? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Oanongaen meeta ewop noa epwene pwae noa, nge oanongaen meeta e pwanipwan nge epwe pwae noa noan seram. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Jesus a pwan aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening gacch minne oawwa rongorong! Meeta rhag oaw apwiungiiur aaemweoi wooan, epwan ina rhag meeta Deus epwe aeyae ngaenigaemi, nge epwe faer cchoaw noa egius. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Pwe iyo a yor meeta aan nge repwe pwan fang ngaeni, nge iyo ese yor meeta aan nge repwe pwigi saengi mwo nge iwe egius iwe eyor reen.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Foat we e Menaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jesus a soapwei noa aan kkepas ngaeniir, “E ieen wunuunun minne Mweoiun Deus. Erhai mwaaen e aeperes faiun foat wooan aan menaai. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>A maiur nee pwoong nge emmas nee raaen, nge faiun foat we ina e memmenaw tae rhag. Nge iiy esoapw metefaaegini ifa wunuunun aaen faiun foat we memmenaw tae. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Ppweon we minne e sipegin feeori meeta irae we epwe menawtae me uuwa reen, mmwan a sumwunutae, mwirin a yor aetin, nge oarosan a yor uwaan. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Nge igiwe minikkewe faiun ra maaw, iwe ra gopin, pwe a toori oaton gin.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Faiun <char style="tl">Mustard</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luke 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Jesus a pwan aepesa pwe, “Meeta sipwe mmwenen awewe ngaeni miniwe Mweoiun Deus? Aere ifa taeppen fioangon awewe sipwe aeyae pwe sipwe mmwenen aemmetefa? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>A aweweei ngaeni efai faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char>, iwe e oarosaen mwittig saengi pwiginnin oanongaen irae. Erhai mwaaen a pwigi faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> we a noa foatogitiw ne ppweon. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Mwirin a menawtae faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> we iwe a ssiuwen ngaeni efoarh irae e faeregit saengi oanongaen irae kkewe noan menaai we. A gin raerae noa, nge man aeniaen ra itto ffeeor feseer noan nniuriun irae we.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Jesus a fenaiuw ngaeniir aeremas kkepesaen Deus nge e aeyae taeppen fioangon awewe kkeei. A kkepas ngaeniir reen nepaen minne repwe mmwenen metefaaegini. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Aan kkepas ngaeniir, nge e kkepas rhag noan fioangon awewe. Nge nipwaen a iiy noa rhag reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun, a aemmetefa ngaeniir wewen iiy kkepas kkewe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Oapoassaetiw Eew Aaeng Cchoaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luke 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Noan faefin we rhag nge Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oaw sipwe noa epeig meoneoiniun eei.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Iwe ra siusaengi mwirhaen aeremas kkewe, iwe nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra teeotae wooan pwoot we Jesus eno wooan, iwe ra pwigi noa. Epwan yor aekkaew pwoot igiwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Iwe rhag nge eew aaeng cchoaw a itto nge noa a nniunong noan pwoot we, iwe a arapakkaan epwene mweoiusiutiw. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Jesus eno mwirin pwoot we pwe e maiur e wonotae rhimwen wooan eew iuniun. Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra faingitae ra aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, wose aetenaegiy aarh sipwene mae?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Iwe Jesus a iutae nge a kkepas sseor ngaeni aaeng we, “Anniug noa!” A pwan aengaeni noa, “Maniuweniuw tiw.” Iwe aaeng a seotiw, nge a pwan rhoaraeg noa weei saaet. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Meeta oawwa mesag reen? Esaaen yor rhag aaemi niugiuniug?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Iwe ra piungiun mesag nge ra aeiineo wooar pwe, “Iyo mwaaen een? Aaeng mwo me noa nge re tapweei mwaenian!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luke 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra toori noa epeig meoneoiniuniun Galilee noan faniuwaen Gerasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>E teeotiw rhag Jesus me wooan pwoot we, nge erhai mwaaen a itto reen nge etowow me noan paeyi kkewe. Mwaaen een eno erhai aniu aenneew wooan, <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>nge e nonno rhag weni niipw. Esooar erhai ne emmwenen feoti ngaeni ccheen; <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>faaen fitowu mwo aar geoni paiun me pirheen, nge esooaw feffereei noa rhag, iwe me egaen ripiy parang we ammwarhiun ngaeni pirheen. Mwaaen een e igin mamaaw iwe esooar erhai ne epwe mmwenen ammwarhiu. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Nee pwoong me nee raaen aan mwetefetaen rhag neeiin paeyi kkewe me weei rhug, aan gaen iyaekkepwas me wunei oanongan ngaeni faai.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>E rhiuwen taaw noa nge a weri Jesus, nge a fattapw ngaeni, nge a foat pwiugiuwtiw me weni mmwan, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>nge a aekkepwas temoag tae, “Jesus, Naiun Deus iwe e oarosaen Taegias! Meeta minne wo tipaeni me reei? Iya tingoar ngaeniug mmwaen mesaen Deus pwe wosoapw aewwaeiraesiaei.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>(E iura kkepas een pwe igiwe Jesus a faer kkepas ngaeni pwe, “Aniu aenneew, toowow me reen mwaaen na!”)<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Iwe, Jesus a aeiineow pwe, “Meeta itoamw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Itaei nge Cchon, pwe aemaem aei igin towunap!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Nge aniu aenneew we e tingoar maaw ngaeni rhag Jesus pwe esoapw asiiur wow me noan faniuw we.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Eyor eew cchon sino arapeto pwiuneoi we re mwongo wooan rhoangorhoang we. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Iwe aniu aenneew kkewe ra aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus pwe, “Fangenoa aemaem neeiir sino kenaan, wa fang ngaenigemaem pwe aeipwe wartae wooar.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Jesus a fangenoa iir, nge aniu aenneew kkewe ra toowow saengi mwaaen we nge ra noa wartae wooar sino kkewe. Oanongaen cchon sino kkewe, iwe re aerepa riiungeras ra fattapw tiw me wenepeigin rhug we ittiw noan meoneoiniun we nge remoapw noa.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Mwaaen kkewe rhooan ffooanon sino ra fattapw noa nge ra noa oaronga fetaeneei miniwe ewen noan aepinoamw we me menaai kkewe. Aeremas ra noa ngaeni neniy we pwe repwe noa pipiiy miniwe a wen, <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>nge igiwe ra itto reen Jesus, ra giuneei mwaaen we eyor cchon aniu aenneew wooan. A mooat igiwe nge e memmengaag, nge iiy man reepiy, iwe oanongeer ra maegin mesag. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Iwe rhooawe reweri meeta we ewen ra fioangei ngaeniir aeremas meeta we a wen ngaeni mwaaen we eyor aniu aenneew wooan me sino kkewe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Iwe ra tingoar ngaeni Jesus pwe epwe siusaengi miniwe faniuweer.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Nge igiwe Jesus a teeotae wooan pwoot we, mwaaen we eyor aniu aenneew wooan a tingoar ngaeni pwe, “Emmwen pwe ipwe tapweog?”<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Nge Jesus ese mwerhaen. A aengaeni pwe, “Sefaaen noa noan imwoamw reen oamw famini nge wa fioangei ngaeniir minikka Soamwoon a feeori ngaeniug, iwe me aan igin gacch ngaeniug.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Iwe mwaaen we a siusaengi, a noa noan oanongaen miniwe Seig Aepinoamw, a noa aepesa miniwe Jesus a feeori ngaeni. Oanongeer rhooa kkewe re rongorong nge ra igin riutae.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naiun Jairus Rhooapwut me Rhooapwut we e Geotteopa Mengaagiun Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luke 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Jesus a sefaaen noa epeig nooamw we. Reen ngaerhen meoneoiniun we nge regin towunap aeremas kka ra mwirhito reen. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Jairus, erhai soamwoonin noan wutteer Jews we a itto, nge igiwe a weri Jesus, a aesirowu tiw me oaron pirheen <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>nge a tingoar aeffaenipirhe ngaeni pwe, “Aeterhooapwut mwittig na naeyi a igin cchoaw aan semwaai. Faaen pirhemw itto wopwe iseni tae poawumw wooan pwe epwe takketae me epwe menaw!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Iwe Jesus a tapweei noa mwaaen we. Re igin towunap aeremas kka ra tapweei noa Jesus ra aetietiy ngaeni oanongaen wenepeigin.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Eno erhai rhooapwut neeiir eseiug aan peitaeg noa noan seig me ruwowu raeg, <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>inamwo igiwe a sefaaen me reer towunepeer toagota. A pwan naini oanongaen naiun senaapiy, nge faer egius mwo nge efaer kkaein noa. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Oatowe rhooapwut we a rongorong wunuunun kkepesaen Jesus, a itto me niugiusagiuriun neeiin pinowun aeremas kkewe, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>nge a maengiy noan tipan pwe, “Aere i geotteopa rhag mengaagiun, nge ipwe mamaaw tae.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Reen rhag oatowe e geotteopa mengaagiun, nge semwaai we aan a iug noa, nge a meyaefi wooan oanongan pwe a rhigar saengi waeiraes we aan. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Iwe rhag nge Jesus a meyaefi pwe eew kkeman a toowow saengi, iwe a toagun ngaeniir aeremas kkewe nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Iyo we a geotteopa mengaagiuy?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Woweriir aeremas kka re aetietiy ngaeniug rhag, nge meeta wa aeiineo iyo we a geotteopoag reen?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Nge Jesus a fanefetaen pwe epwe giuneei iyo we a feeori miniwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Nge igiwe rhooapwut we a giuneei meeta we a wen ngaeni, a ngongotae reen aan mesag, iwe a itto foatotiw me oaron pirheen iwe a pwaeri ngaeni weneccheran meeta we a wen ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Naeyi, oamw niugiuniug minne a aecchipwoag tae. Wonoa noan oapoas pwe wa rhigar saengi oamw waeiraes.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Nge igiwe Jesus e rhiuwen kekkepas, aaemweoi rhooan pweipwogin kkepas ra itto me reen imwaen Jairus ra aengaeni pwe, “A mae noa rhooapwut we noawumw. E rhiuwen meeta ipitaen oamw itiwow angiurhiu no ngaeni sinsei na?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Nge Jesus ese aefaenniy meeta we re aepesa, nge a aengaeni Jairus pwe, “Wote mesag, niugiuniug rhag.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Jesus esa tipaeni no nge erhai epwe tapweei, pwe aaen Peter rhag me James me John iwe pwiin. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Igiwe ra tooto reen imwaen Jairus, Jesus a giuneei aar pwurhopwurh fetaen me rongorong aar oacchorong me ngiuraegin aar saeng. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Iwe a toonong noan iimw we a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oawwa pwurhopwurh fetaen reen? Meeta oawwa saeng reen? Aeteen nge ese mae, pwe aan rhag maiur.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Iwe ra kekkaei aegini, iwe a asiiur wow oanongeer me noan iimw we, nge a paeniir seman me inaen aeterhooapwut we, me eoniurhai naiun rhooan kkayeo, iwe a paeniir nong noan sengkin we aeterhooapwut we ewon ee. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>A ammwarhiu tae paiun nge a aengaeni pwe, “Talitha koum!” faaen minneen nge, “Aeterhooapwut, i aengaeniug wopwe rhimwitae!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>E iutae rhag nge a faaeraeg fetaen. (Iya seig me ruwowu raegin.) Nge igiwe a wen miniwe oanongaen aeremas kkewe ra igin riutae. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Nge Jesus a aetiwenigiy ngaeniir pwe resoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai, nge a pwan aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw ngaenneei meeta epwe angi”.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Nazareth Rese Aetiwa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luke 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Jesus a siusaengi pwiuneoi we nge a sefaaen ngaeni pwugusan, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra pwan tapweei noa. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Wooan raaenin Sabbath nge a rhaepiy tae aan fenai noan wutteer Jews we. Re towunap aeremas igiwe nge igiwe rhooa rongorong aan fenai ra igin mwaar reen. Ra aeiineo pwe, “Iya minne e pwigi minikkeei me ee? Meeta taeppen reepiy e refang ngaeni? Ifa wusun nge a mmwen ngaeni aan feeori kkeman kaan? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Saapw ieen taikusang we naiun Maria, iwe pwiin James, Joseph, Judas me Simon? Me saapw mwengeyan rhooapwut kka reno igeei?” Iwe resa aetiwa no.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Profeta eyor aesirowuur me noan oanongaen pwiuneoi, nge ese yor aesirowuur me noan sipegin pwuguseer, me reer aeremeseer me aar famini.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Ese mmwen epwe feeori kkeman me igiwe, pwe efaer aetekkaar tae rhag aaemweoi rhooa semwaai reen aan iseni tae paiun wooar. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>A gin ssef tae nee tipan reer aeremas kkewe esooar aar niugiuniug.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesus a Fangenoa Seig me Riiurhai Rhooan Kkayeo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luke 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Iwe Jesus a noa noan pwugos kkewe e arapeto, nge a fenai ngaeniir oanongeer aeremas. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>A faingi fengaenniir rhooawe seig me riiurhai rhooan kkayeo nge a aefengaar noa riiurhai me riiurhai. A fang ngaeniir maemaeweer pwe repwe asiiur aniu aenneew me wooar aeremas, <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>nge a pwan anneogiu ngaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw pwigi mwo nge eew meeta wooan aaemi saei pwe eew rhag yoyo, esoapw yor aenaemi, aaemi pwetoaw, esoapw yor senaapiy noan pwoarsaemi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Oaw nokka, nge oawsoapw pwigi mwo epeo ssiuwenin mengaagiumi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>A pwan aengaeniir pwe, “Ese tiwegin iya re aetiwaegaemi me ee, oawno noan iimw naan toori aaemi oawpwe siu me reen aepinoamw naan. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Ngaere oaw toori eew taeninimw, nge rese aetiwaegaemi aere aiussaening ngaenigaemi, oaw siusaengi pwiuneoi we nge oawwa iurhiugi noa ppweoniun pwiuneoi we me wooan pirhemi. Minna ina epwene no pwe eew atapeonneog ngaeniir.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Iwe ra noa fenaiuw ngaeniir aeremas pwe repwe toagun saengi aar monofit. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Ra asiiur noa towunepaen aniu aenneew me wooar aeremas, nge ra aepiti ngaeniir tiikka towunepaen rhooa semwaai kkewe iwe ra aecchipwaar tae.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maenoan John Baptist</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luke 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Igiwe <char style="tl">king</char> Erotes a rongorong wunuunun kkepesaen Jesus, pwe itan a rheeoi noa wooan oanongaen pwiuneoi. Aaemweoi aeremas ra aepesa pwe “John Baptist a menaw sefaaen saengi mae noa! Ina faaen minne eyor maemaewan pwe epwe feeori kkeman kkeei reen.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Aaemweoi re aepesa pwe, “Iiy Elijah.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Nge aaemweoi re aepesa pwe, “Iiy erhai profeta, taeppeer profeta kkewe mweoiwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Igiwe Erotes a rongorong miniwe, a aepesa pwe, “Iiy John Baptist we i gopiy noa iiuwan nge imwu a menaw sefaaen!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Erotes miniwe e akkiuneo pwe repwe torofi John nge ra geoni iwe ra oatoranong noan kanepwus. Erotes a feeori minneei faaen itaen Herodias iwe a pwiuniuwaeni, nge rhooapwut een nge pwan pwiuniuwaen Philip iwe pwiin. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>John Baptist a aepini ngaeni Erotes pwe, “Ese fin pwe wopwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut mwu pwiuniuwaen pwiimw!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Iwe Herodias a gin soong wooan John nge a gin mwerhaen pwe epwe niiy noa, nge ese mmwen ngaeni pwe reen Erotes. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Erotes e mesagiu John, pwe a giuneei pwe iiy erhai mwaaen mwamwaai nge essoar, iwe e aemmwena fetaeneei rhag. Erotes e aerhaengi aan epwe rongorong ngaeni aaen John fenai, inamwo aere egaen kkaein noa aenneewaen tipan iga egaen rongorong ngaeni.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Oarosan nge Herodias a yo ngaeni niunniuwaen we aan. Wooan raaenin wupwutiwen Erotes, igiwe efeeori eew gupwunnap faaen iteer naiun naiwiis, naiun soamwoonin sonotaw me aeremas kkewe re taegias me noan Galilee. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Oatowe rhooapwut we naiun Herodias a toonong nge a itinong pwaai, Erotes me rhooawe rhoaniuwan ra gin kker reen. Iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a aengaeni aeterhooapwut we pwe, “Meeta wo tipaeni wopwe aeni? Ngaang ipwe ngaenneog ese tiwegin minne wo tipaeni.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>A pwan ppwon ngaeni pwe, “Ngaang ipwe ngaenneog ese tiwegin meeta wo tingoar, inamwo esoapw me reen minne nemaeniaei!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Iwe aeterhooapwut we a noa aeiineow miniwe inan pwe, “Meeta ngaang ipwe tingoar?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Rhooapwut we inan a paniuwaeni pwe, “Minna rhimwen John Baptist.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Iwe aeterhooapwut we a mwetekkaein sefaaen noa reen <char style="tl">king</char> we nge a tingoar ngaeni pwe, “I mwerhaen pwe igina rhag nge wopwe ngaenneaei rhimwen John Baptist noan eew saepiy.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Minneen nge a gin aenneewa noa nee tipan <char style="tl">king</char> we, nge ese mmwen pwe epwe aesefaaeni pwe reen ppwon kkewe a feeori faaen meseer rhooa towunap kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Iwe a fangenoa rhag erhai sonotaw nge a aengaeni pwe epwe pwigito rhimwen John. Iwe sonotaw we a noa, a noa reen noan kanepwus we, a noa gopiy noa iiuwaen John; <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>iwe a pwigito rhimw we noan eew saepiy a itto ngaenneei aeterhooapwut we, nge iya ngaenneei miniwe inan. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Nge igiwe rhooawe naiun John rhooan kkayeo ra rongorong, ra itto pwigi miniwe oanongan nge ra noa paeia noa.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Oamwongoor Nimingeras Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luke 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">John 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Oapostonus kkewe ra sefaaeneto reen Jesus nge ra aengaeni oanongaen meeta ra feeori, pwan minikka ra aeni fenai. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Igiwe a gin towunap aeremas kka re maegeto me maegenoa, Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun esa mmwen no repwe mwongo. Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsa noa oaw giirh rhag eew pwiuneoi taaw noa, pwe oawpwe egius mmwenen aseoseo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Iwe iir noa rhag ra noa wooan efoarh pwoot nge ra noa ngaeni eew pwiuneoi esooar aeremesan.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nge towunepeer aeremas kka reweriir aar siunoa nge re giuneer pwe iir iyo, iwe ra siusaengi aepinoamwoor, ra fattapw noa me weni faniuw nge ra toori pwiuneoi we memmweer Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Nge igiwe Jesus a teeotiw me wooan pwoot we, a giuneei pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, iwe nge a igin faayeeor, pwe ra aeffitaeg ngaeniir <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe esooar rhooan neginegiir. Iwe a rhaepiy tae aan fenaiuw ngaeniir towunepaen aegiaeg. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Noan faefin we, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra aengaeni pwe, “E igin anniug noa igeei, nge a pwan pwoong. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Wone fangenoa aeremas kena noan maat me pwugos kkomwu e arapeto pwe repwe noa chuwaai aeneer mwongo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi oawpwe ngaenneer meeta repwe mwongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Iwe ra aeiineow pwe, “Wo mwerhaen aeipwe noa chuwaai fenoawa ngaeni riiuwapwiugiuw faiun <char style="tl">silver</char>, pwe repwe mwongo?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Iwe Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Fitifai fenoawa eyor reemi? Oawnoa pipiiy.”<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00155B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="Mark 6.38"/></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Nge igiwe ra giuneei, ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “A yor niffai fenoawa me riiurhai iig.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Jesus aepesa ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oaw aengaeniir aeremas kena pwe repwe mooat tiw wooan fetin nge epwe imweoi noa aaemweoi me aaemweoi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Iwe rhooanap we ra mooat tettaen noa, nge aaemweoiut aepwiugiuw, nge aaemweoiut aenimeig. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Iwe Jesus a pwigi fenoawa we niffai me iig kkewe riiurhai, a fattae naaeng nge a fang ngaeni Deus aan aerhigerhig. A giniiy fenoawa kkewe a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe inetiy ngaeniir aeremas kkewe. A pwan giniiy iig kkewe riiurhai pwe epwe toaw wooar aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Oanongeer nge ra maegin mwongo iwe ra faeyemwaai noa. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra ioni fengaenniy iwe ra oawuta seig me ruwowu rhiug reen nusegin fenoawa me iig kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Iwe nepeer mwaaen kkewe re mwongo nge nimingeras.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Faaeraeg Noa Weei Saaet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">John 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Iwe noan rhag oatowe nge Jesus a aepekkaar rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe teeotae wooan pwoot we, nge ra gommwonoa Bethsaida iwe epeig meoneoiniun we, nge iiy a aefengaar noa aeremas kkewe pwe repwe sefaaen ngaeni nenieer. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Mwirin aan koapwong ngaeniir aeremas kkewe, a faaeraeg tae wooan eew rhug pwe epwe noa maeipin. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Oatowe a pwongonoa, pwoot we a toori nugunupaen meoneoiniun we, nge Jesus a iiy noa rhag weni faniuw. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Iwe a giuneei pwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra aerhigaen fatiun, pwe iga re fatiun ngaeni aaeng; nge nepetaen enuuw me wonowu konook nee oatosor raaen nge a itto reer, nge e faaeraeg to weei saaet. Nge aetae epwene oanuuw saengiir, <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>nge ra weri pwe a faaeraeg weei saaet. Ra maengiy pwe erhai aniu, nge ra aekkepwastae. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Ra maegin mesag tae igiwe ra weri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Reen rhag oateen nge Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir pwe, “Oaw aemenetaegaemi! Ngaang minneei. Oawsoapw mesag!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Iwe Jesus a teeotae reer wooan pwoot we, nge aaeng we a maseoseotiw. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra mwaar, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>pwe rese metefaaegini meeta faaen miniwe Jesus enoa mmwenen oamwongoor rhooawe nimingeras reen, iwe rese iit faan.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwaar Rhooa Semwaai me Wooan Gennesaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Iwe ra seraeg noa epeig meoneoiniun we iwe ra itto noan Gennesaret, nge ra noa feotaegini waa we waar me ee. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Re tiwenong rhag me wooan pwoot we waar, nge aeremas ra aeginna Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Iwe ra peres fetaen wooan oanongaen faniuw, pwe ese tiwegin iga re rongorong pwe eno e, nge ra pwigiir to rhooa semwaai kka rewon noan gieer. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Iwe nge oanongaen pwiuneoi e Jesus enoa ee, noan pwugos, aere noan aepinoamw aere noan maat, nge aeremas repwe pweipwog to mane semwaai noan nenien chuwaai nge ra itto tingoar ngaeni Jesus pwe aere uwen aar mwo man semwaai geotteopa soapwon mengaagiun. Iwe oanongeer iyo kkewe re geotteopa ra mamaaw noa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Aar Fenai Rhaepeto Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees me sinsein anniug kkewe re itto me Jerusalem ra mwirhito reen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Ra giuneei pwe aaemweoi me neeiir naiun Jesus rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra mwongo wooan paiiur nge e nimaenneew, pwe rese toafi paiiur taeppen minna Pharisees re aengaeniir aeremas pwe repwe feeori.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>(Pwe Pharisees me oanongeer Jews, re tapweei rhag miniwe rhaepeto kkewe aar ra aeni fenai ngaeniir: Re fasiun gaen toafi paiiur taeppen wunuunun toatoan pai na iir re fasiun feoffeeori weni mmwaen aar repwe mwongo; <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>nge rese pwan mwongo minikka e itto me noan imwaen chuwaai igine rese nniuwan mwo. Iwe nge repwan tapweei rhag ssowun anniug kkewe re fasiun aengaeniir, wunuunun aar toafi kkap, raaw, saepiy me gieer.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Iwe Pharisees me sinsein anniug kkewe ra aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Meeta rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw rese tapweei aar fenai rhaepeto kkewe aarh reen, nge ra faer mwongo wooan paiiur min nimaenneew?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “A gin weneeti meeta we Isaiah a faer fenaiuw pwe wunuunumi. Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw, taeppen rhag aan foatogi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Deus a aepesa pwe: Aeremas kkeei ra oassoamwooniaei rhag reen aar kkepas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">nge nee tipeer a igin taaw saengiaei.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Esooar ipitaen aar aesirowuwaei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">pwe re fenaiuw aar aeremas anniug,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">nge ra feeori pwe aetae gaen aaei anniug.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>“Aaemi oawwa oatoranoa aaen Deus anniug, nge oawwa tapweei feeoriaen aeremas.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Nge Jesus a soapwei noa pwe, “Oaw igin angmwamwaai reen aaemi oawpwe arhiuwa noa anniug kkewe aaen Deus minni aaemi oawpwe aemaemaewa kkomi. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Pwe Moses a aepesa pwe, ‘Wopwe aesirowu semoamw me inoamw,’ iwe me, ‘Iyo a oari seman aere inan, nge repwe niiy noa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Nge aaemi oawwa aepesa pwe aere erhai a yor reen aekkaew meeta epwe tipaengi ngaeni seman aere inan, nge a aepesa pwe, ‘Minneen nge Corban,’ (faaen minneen nge aaen Deus), <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>iwe a yor pweniun pwe esoapw tipaengi seman aere inan. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Reen taeppen fenai e oawwa aengaeniir aeremas nge e oamoai noa mwaeniaen Deus. Nge e towunap aegiaeg oawfeeori ikka e ieei wusun.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minikka e Aenimaenneewa Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Iwe Jesus a faingiir to pwuwaen aeremas kkewe nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening ngaeniaei oanongaemi, pwe oawpwe metaf. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Esooar meeta minne epwe toonong nee rhiumi nge epwe aenimaenneewagaemi noa. Pwe faer minne etowow me nee rhiumi minne epwe aenimaenneewagaemi. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>[Iyo a yor saeningan, epwe rongorong.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note>”<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Igiwe a mwet saengi aeremas kkewe a noa toonong nee iimw, iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra tingoar ngaeni pwe epwe aemmetefa ngaeniir faaen kkepas kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iwe aaemi mwo nge oawse metaf pwan taeppen rhag ikkina aaemweoi? Oawse metaf? Esooar minne epwe toonong nee rhiumi nge epwe aenimaenneewagaemi, <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>pwe ese toonong noan pwunnomi pwe etonong noan upwaemi, mwirin a toowow saengi oanongaemi.” (Reen kkepas een nge Jesus a pwaeritae pwe oanongaen mwongo nge egacch pwe aeremas repwe mwongo.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Nge a soapwei noa nge aepesa pwe, “Meeta a toowow saengi nee rhiumi minne e aenimaenneewagaemi. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Pwe saengi nee rhiumi me pwunnomi, a toowow niunniuwaen aenneew, feoffeeor aenneew fetaen, mwoarho, nni menaw, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai, rhegoaw me towunepaen min aenneew, oatupwutupw, mwechenia, noanowo, kkepas aenneew, oangonongon me tipoarorh. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Oanongan feoffeeor kkeei nge etowow saengi nee rhiumi a itiwow aenimaenneewagaemi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Erhai Rhooapwut Niugiuniug</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Iwe Jesus a noa saengi igiwe a noa eew pwiuneoi e arap ngaeni aepinoamwon Tyre. A toonong noan eew iimw nge ese tipaeni pwe erhai epwe giuneei pwe a no igiwe, nge ese mmwenen wop ssiunaei igiwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Iwe nge erhai rhooapwut eyor naiun aeterhooapwut ewartae aniu aenneew wooan, a rongorong wunuunun Jesus nge a itto reen nge a itto foatotiw oaron pirheen. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Rhooapwut een nge erhai rhooapwuton Gentile, a wupwutiw noan faniuwaen Phoenicia iwe noan Syria. A tingoar aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus pwe epwe asiuw wow aniu aenneew we me reen aeterhooapwut we naiun. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Sipwe mmwaen oamwongoor wonigaet. Ese mwamwaai pwe sipwe pwigi aeneer wonigaet mwongo nge sa oatora ngaeniir gonaag.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Rhooapwut we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Menap, gonaag mwo nge re mwongo peipeyin aeneer wonigaet me faaen <char style="tl">table</char>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Pwonno reen minimwu mwaenioamw, wone sefaaen noa nee iimw, pwe e aniu aenneew we a toowow me reen aeterhooapwut we noawumw.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Iwe rhooapwut we a noa nee iimw nge a noa weri aetewe naiun pwe ewon noan gien, nge ennetaen pwe aniu aenneew we a siunoa me wooan.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Niparh Ewan me Saeningan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Jesus a noa saengi faniuwaen Tyre a noa ngaeni Sidon toori meoneoiniuniun Galilee, nge a mwet nong noan faniuwaen Decapolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra noa pwigito reen Jesus erhai mwaaen e saeningapiung nge egin waeiraes epwe kkepas, nge ra aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus pwe epwe iseni tae paiun wooan. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Iwe Jesus a paeninoa mwaaen we saengiir aeremas kkewe, a tugunong noan saeningaen mwaaen we, nge a oattuffa, nge a geotteopa rheoniuwan. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Mwirin Jesus a fattae naaeng, a nngas faeregit noa, nge a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Ephphatha!” faaen nge “Sugaeg tae!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Iwe rhag nge mwaaen we a mmwen epwene rongorong, a saenetaeg noa rheon ngaerhen, nge a rhaepetae aan kkepas. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Iwe Jesus a anniugiu ngaeniir aeremas kkewe pwe resoapw fioangei ngaeni mwo nge erhai; nge nepaen aan anniugiu ngaeniir, nge nepaen aar noa aepesa fetaeneei. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Oanongeer rhooawe re rongorong kkepas we ra gin mwaar. Ra aepesa pwe, “A igin mwamwaai oanongaen minikka a feeori. Epwan feeori mwo nge rhooa piung repwene rongorong, me rhooa parh eweri repwene kkepas.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Oamwongoor Faangeras Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Ese pwongiy mwo me mwirin nge pwuwaen aeremas ra itto rhu fengaen. Oatowe a rosonoa aeneer mwongo, nge Jesus a faingiir to rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Iya faayeeor rhooa eei, pwe iga ra no reei noan eoniuraen, nge iye igina a rosonoa aeneer mwongo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Aere ipwe aesefaaeniir noa nee pwuguseer nge ise oamwongoor, nge repwe niyoarorhrorh, pwe aaemweoi e gitaaw nenieer.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Iwe, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya me noan pwiuneoi anniug noa eei iye sipwe rhurhu mwongo me ee nge epwe nap wooar rhooa eei?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Fitifai fenoawa eyor reemi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ra paniuwaeni pwe “Fiusiufai.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>A anniugiu ngaeniir rhooanap we pwe repwe mooat tiw weni ppweon. Iwe a pwigi fiusiufai fenoawa nge a aengaeni Deus aan aerhigerhig, a giniytiw nge a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe pwe repwe inetiy ngaeniir rhooanap we, iwe ra feeori. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Epwan yor reer fitiman iig paecchig. Jesus a pwan fang aan aerhigerhig, iwe a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe inetiy ngaeniir rhooanap we. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9"/>Oanongeer re mwongo nge ra faeyemwaai. Nnepeer aeremas kkewe nge epwe sooaw faangeras. Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra oawuta fisuuw rhiug reen nusegin mwongo kkewe. Iwe Jesus a aefengaar noa aeremas kkewe nee pwuguseer, <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Nge Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra teeotae wooan efoarh pwoot, ra saei ngaeni faniuwaen Dalmanutha.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharisees Kkewe ra Tingoar Eew Kkeman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees ra itto reen Jesus nge ra rhaepeta aar appaniuwaeni. Re mwerhaen repwe aegina, iwe ra tingoar ngaeni pwe epwe feeori eew kkeman, pwe epwe pwae pwe Deus e tipieew ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Nge Jesus a nngas faeregit noa nge aepesa pwe, “Meeta minne aeremesaen mweoi e igina ra tingoar eew kkeman reen? Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe esoapw yor eew kkeman epwe pwae ngaeniir aeremas kkeei.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>A nigitiir, a teeotae wooan pwoot we a noa peig we epeig me reen meoneoiniun we.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar <char style="tl">Yeast</char> Pharisees me Erotes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe re maniuwegi noa repwe oayora pwigieer fenoawa, iwe efoarh rhag fenoawa minne eno reer wooan pwoot we. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Iwe Jesus a atapeonneogiiur pwe, “Oawpwe aefaennigaemi reen <char style="tl">yeast</char> we aar Pharisees me Erotes.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Iwe ra rhaepetae aar fioang wooar pwe, “A aepesa minneen pwe iga esooar fenoawa reerh.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jesus e fasiun giuneei meeta we re aepesa, iwe a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta faan aaemi aepesa aan esooar fenoawa reen? Oawsaaen giuneei aere oawsaaen metaf mwo? E rhiuwen roorh noan rhimwemi? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Eyor mesaemi, oawse weriwer? Eyor saeningaemi, oawse rongorong? Oawse maengiy <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>oatowe i giniiy niffai fenoawa wooar rhooawe nimingeras? Fitowu rhiug oawwa oawuta reen nusegin mwongo?” Iwe, ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Seig me riuwarhiug.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Nge oatowe i giniiy fiusiufai fenoawa wooar rhooawe faangeras, nge fitowu rhiug esseog reen minikkewe nusegin mwongo?” Iwe ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Fisuuw rhiug.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>“Oawsaaen metaf mwo?” aaen Jesus aeiineo.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aeffetanoa Mesaen Erhai Mwaaen me Wooan Bethsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Ra itto Bethsaida, nge aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigito reen Jesus erhai mwaaen parh nge ra aeffaenipirheei pwe epwe geotteopa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Jesus a ammwarhiu paiun mwaaen we a paeni wow me niugiun pwugos we. Mwirin aan oattuffa mesaen mwaaen we, nge a iseni tae paiun wooan, nge a aeiineow pwe, “Yor minne wa weri?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Mwaaen we a mmas noa nge a iura pwe, “Ooa, iya weriir aeremas, nge nigiti pwe reweei waniwan kka re faaeraeg fetaen.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Jesus a pwan iseni sefaaen tae paiun wooan mesaen mwaaen we. Reen oateen nge mwaaen we a fan wenewen noa, pwe a ffat sefaaen minikkiwe mesan pwe a weri oanongaen aegiaeg. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Jesus a fangenoa mwaaen we nee pwugusan nge a ammwir ngaeni pwe, “Wosoapw rhiuwen sefaaen noa reen oasoasoa na.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Iura pwe Jesus Ina Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luke 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Iwe nge Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa noan aepinoamw kkewe ngaerhen Caesarea Philippi. Noan aar feffaaeraeg noa, nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Oaw aengaeniaei, aeremas re iura pwe ngaang iyo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Iwe nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Aaemweoi re iura pwe een John Baptist, aaemweoi re iura pwe een Elijah, nge pwan aaemweoi re iura pwe een erhai profeta kkewe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Nge aaemi, oaw iura pwe ngaang iyo?” Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een Kristus.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Iwe nge Jesus a oasoapwosoapw ngaeniir pwe, “Esooar ne oawpwe aengaeni wunuunun mmwenei.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aepesa Waeiraesin me Maenoan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luke 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Iwe Jesus a rhaepiy aan fenaiiur rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge e iura pwe, “Minna Naiun Aeremas ina epwe kkaein aan affayeo nge epwe serhoawun me reer mwaaen kkewe aar, soamwooniir patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe. Repwe niiy noa, nge mwirin eoniuraen nge epwe menaw sefaaen.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>E igin aeffeta ngaeniir wunuunun minneei. Iwe Peter a wummwuw noa egius a noa soong ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Nge Jesus a toagun ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a soong ngaeni Peter. E iura pwe, “Rhiuw me oaroi, Saetan, pwe oamw niunniuwaen ese itto me reen Deus, pwe e itto me reen aeremas.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Iwe Jesus a faingi pwuwa we me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun. Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Erhai ne e mwerhaen tapweaei, epwe aerheei noa niunniuwaennen wooan oanongan, a aiufera aan kurus nge a tapweeito mwiriy. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Pwe iyo e mwerhaen ammwarhiu menewan epwe ppiung saengi, nge iyo eppiung saengi menewan faaen itaei pwan faaen itaen Kkepas Mwamwaai we nge epwe menaw. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Epwe meeta ipitan aaen yo faeinaengiy nniuw noa ngaeni erhai, nge ese yo ngaeni menewan? Esooar ngaere! <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Esoapw yor meeta erhai epwe tongaeni fangenoa pwe epwe pwigi sefaaeniy menewan. <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Aere wosaew aeginiaei me fenai kena aaei faaen mweoi e sseogiun monofit, ina nge mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe pwan saew aeginiug oatona epwe itto noan nningen minna Seman fengaen me angkenus kena ressoar.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Iwe a pwan aepesa pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe eyor aaemweoi aeremas igeei resoapw mae, toori oatona repwe weri itton minna Mweoiun Deus epwe itto noan mamaaw.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nniuwen Noan Wunuunun Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luke 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Mwirin wonowu raaen nge Jesus a paeniir tae Peter, James me John wooan eew rhug taegias, nge a iir noa rhag ee. Igiwe re rhiuwen oawruru Jesus, nge a nniuwen noa wunuunun, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>mengaagiun a moanuponup reen aan pwerheraeg noa, pwerheraeg saengi mwo nge wupwuwaen erhai mengaag me noan faeinaengiy. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Iwe nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe eoniurhai ra weri Elijah me Moses aar kkepas ngaeni Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Iwe Peter a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, a igin gacch pwe sino igeei. Aeipwe aiuwtae enuuw iimw tampwoning, eew imwoamw, eew imwaen Moses, me eew imwaen Elijah.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Iiy me rhooa kkewe rhoaniuwan ra igin mesag, iwe Peter esa giuneei no meeta epwe rhiuwen aepesa.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Iwe eew toapw a itto pwaniiur noa, nge ra rongorong eew mangiungiu e itto me noan toapw we, “Ieei Naeyi mwaaen aerhaengerhaeng, oaw aiussaening ngaeni!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Ra mwetekkaein wegitaeg fetaen nge esooar ne reweri, pwe aaen Jesus rhag minne eno reer.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Igiwe ra ittiw me wooan rhug we, Jesus a igin ammwir ngaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai meeta oawwa weri, toori aaen mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe menaw sefaaen me reen maenoa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Ra tapweei meeta we e Jesus e ammwir ngaeniir, nge a rhaepetae aar kkepas aeiyeg fengaen wooar, “Meeta faan minne menaw sefaaen saengi mae noa?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Iwe ra aeiineow Jesus, “Meeta sinsein anniug ra aepesa, pwe Elijah epwe gommwoto reen?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>A paniuwaeniir pwe, “Epwe fasiun gommwoto Elijah pwe epwe itto oamoannatae oanongaen aegiaeg. Nge meeta rhag a foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus pwe Naiun Aeremas epwe toonong noan waeiraes faeregit me aar oasoarhoawuna? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe Elijah a fasiun itto, nge aeremas ra feeori ngaeni meeta aar mwerhaen, taeppen rhag meeta we Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Erhai Aetemwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luke 9.37-43</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Igiwe ra rhu fengaen me rhooan kkayeo kkewe aaemweoi, ra giuneei pwuwaen aeremas kkewe re pwaeniaeniir me aaemweoi sinsein anniug re aengiingi ngaeniir. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Igiwe aeremas kkewe ra giuneei Jesus, ra riutae, ra fattapw noa reen ra noa aewenimmwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Jesus a aeiineeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Meeta mwu oaw aengiingi fengaen wooan?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Erhai mwaaen me neeiir rhooa towunap we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Sinsei, iya pwigito aete naeyi reemw, pwe eyor aniu aenneew wooan nge ese mmwenen kkepas. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Oate aniu aenneew een epwe wartae wooan, a oatoratiw ne ppweon, nge a pwuropwur wow me noan ewan, e iin noa ngiin iwe me e cchemaw noa oanongaen. Iya aeiyegiir rhooan kkayeo kka noawumw pwe repwe oatowowuw aniu een me wooan, nge ese mmwen ngaeniir.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ifa mwo aaemi se niugiuniug faaen oateei! Epwe ifa ssiunaein aaei ipwe no reemi? Epwe ifa wusun aaei noaneenaei reemi? Oaw pwigito aetena reei!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Ra pwigito aet we reen Jesus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Igiwe rhag aniu aenneew we eweri Jesus, a ngong noa aetewe, iwe a ppiungiutiw ne ppweon a ittiw soagopenipen fetaen nge a pwuropwur wow me noan ewan. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Jesus a aeiineow mwaaen we semaen aetewe pwe, “A ifa pwongiaen aan ieei wusun?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Mwaaen we semaen aetewe a paniuwaeni pwe, “Saengi rhag ne wonigaeten. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>A faei towunap aaen aniu aenneew een menaen epwe niiy noa reen aan aerheei nong noan aengaet me ne rhaan. Faayeogemaem me tipaengi gimaem, aere emmwen ngaeniug!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa, aere een emmwen ngaeniug! Oanongaen aegiaeg nge emmwen ngaeni erhai ne eyor aan niugiuniug.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Mwaaen we semaen aetewe a aekkepwas temoag tae pwe, “Ngaang i niugiuniug nge egius rhag, tipaengiaei epwe temoag noa aaei niugiuniug.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Jesus a giuneei pwe aeremas towunap kkewe ra arapeto reer, iwe a asiuw aniu aenneew we. “Aniun oawparh me saeningapiung, i aengaeniug pwe wopwe toowow me reen aetena, nge wosoapw rhiuwen sefaaeniti no!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Aniu aenneew we a aekkepwas tae, nge a ngong noa aetewe nge a tiw noa me wooan. A weei rhag erhai manimae kkewe, nge rhooa towunap kkewe ra aepesa pwe, “A maenoa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Nge Jesus a ammwarhiu paiun aet we nge a tipaengitae, iwe aetewe a iutae.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Mwirin aaen Jesus toonong nee iimw, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra aeiineow igiwe a iir noa rhag pwe, “Meeta aemaem aeise mmwenen oatowowuw aniu aenneew we reen?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Aeggaen maeipin rhag minne emmwen epwe oatowowuur aniu kaan, esooar pwan eew me niugiunoan.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwan Aepesa Wunuunun Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; Luke 9.43b-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa saengi pwiuneoi we nge ra mwetenoa wooan Galilee. Jesus ese mwerhaen pwe aeremas repwe giuneei iga eno e, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>pwe iga e fenaiiur rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe: “Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwene yonong nee paiiur aeremas kena repwe niiy noa. Nge mwirin enuuw raaen epwe menaw sefaaen.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Nge rese metefaaegini faaen miniwe e aeni fenai, nge re mesag aar repwe aeiineow.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo e oarosaen Taegias?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luke 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Igiwe ra itto Capernaum, nge ra toonong nee iimw, Jesus a aeiineeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Meeta we oaw aengiingi fengaen wooan me wooan ennap?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Nge iir resa paniuwaeni no, pwe iga re aengiingi me wooan ennap aere iyo e oarosaen taegias me neeiir. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Iwe Jesus a mooat tiw, a faingiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Aere erhai ne e mwerhaen pwe epwe gommw, nge iiy epwe oarosaen noa aeremas nge epwe pwan engaang ngaeniir oanongeer aeremas.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>A pwigi erhai wonigaet a aiuwtae me weni mmweer. A ammwarhiu aetewe nge a aengaeniir pwe, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Iyo e aetiwa erhai wonigaet kaan faaen itaei e aetiwaeyaei, nge iyo e aetiwaeyaei ese aetiwaeyaei rhag pwe epwan aetiwa iyo we efangeto ngaang.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo Ese Appaniuwaenigirh Iiy Rhoaniuwarh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luke 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>John a aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, aeiweri erhai mwaaen a oatowowuw aniu aenneew faaen itoamw, nge aeiya aengaeni pwe epwe iug noa, pwe iiy saapw rhoaniuwarh.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw aiugiu noa mwaaen na, pwe esooar erhai ne epwe feeori eew manaman faaen itaei, nge epwe sor sefaaen nge aepesa eew min aenneew faaen itaei. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Pwe iyo ese appaniuwaenigirh nge iiy rhoaniuwarh. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe iyo e aiuniu gaemi rhaan pwe iga aaemi naeyi, iiy epwe yo ngaeni minna paniuwaenin.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sessoaton Monofit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luke 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Aere erhai efeeori pwe erhai maan mwittig kaan epwe maniuwegini noa aan niugiuniug reei, nge efaer gacch pwe epwe geeogeeotae efai faai faaen iiuwan nge a noa aekkaerh noa nee metaw.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00146B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="Mark 9.42"/> <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Aere poawumw efeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa oamw niugiuniug, gopiy noa! Efaer gacch oamw wopwe pai efoarh nge wotonong noan menaw na esooar iyaenin, mmwaen oamw wopwe pai riiufoarh nge wonoa noan nifierno, noan aengaet we ese mmwenen gunnoa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>[Igiwe mwussoa kkewe egaen worheer nge rese mmwenen maenoa, nge aengaet na egaen figiir ese mmwenen gunnoa.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Aere pirhemw efeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa oamw niugiuniug, gopiy noa. Efaer gacch oamw wopwe pirhe efoarh nge wotonong noan menaw na esooar iyaenin, mmwaen oamw wopwe pirhe riiufoarh nge ra aerheog nong noan nifierno. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>[Igiwe mwussoa kkewe egaen worheer nge rese mmwenen maenoa, nge aengaet na egaen figiir ese mmwenen gunnoa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Aere mesoamw efeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa oamw niugiuniug, oannusuwow! Efaer gacch oamw wopwe toonong noan minna Mweoiun Deus reen oamw maseyefai, mmwaen oamw wopwe maseriufai nge ra aerheog nong noan nifierno. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Igiwe mwussoa kkewe egaen worheer nge rese mmwenen maenoa, nge aengaet na egaen figiir ese mmwenen gunnoa.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>“Aeremas towunap repwene nimegacch noa reen aengaet, taeppen eew oasoar e nimegacch noa reen aesiig.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Aesiig egacch; nge igine epwe rhiuw noa saaetiin, nge epwe mmwen sipwe aesaaeti sefaaeniy?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Oayora aesigaen aerhaengerhaeng nee finaemi, nge oawno rhag noan oapoas ngaeni erhai me erhai aaemi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Fenaiuw Mweoimweoyiun Appwiuniupai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luke 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Iwe Jesus a siusaengi igiwe nge a noa noan faniuwaen Judea iwe nge a saei noa wooan rhan pwupwu we Jordan. Aeremas towunap ra pwan mweoiuto reen, nge iya fenaiiur taeppen rhag minna e fasiun gaen feeori.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees ra itto reen pwe repwe soatoni, nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Aengaenigemaem, egacch me noan aarh anniug pwe erhai mwaaen epwe mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeniir ngaeni pwan eew aeiyeg pwe, “Meeta taeppen anniug Moses a ngaennegaemi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Moses e saeneti ngaeni erhai mwaaen pwe epwe foatogi pwapwioron mweoinoa, iwe a nigiti noa pwiuniuwan.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Moses e foatogi anniug een faaen itaen aaemi se rongorong ngaeni aan fenai. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Pwe saengi rhag rhaepetaen feeoriun feoniufan, ‘Deus a feeoriir mwaaen me rhooapwut,’ taeppen rhag miniwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Ieei minne erhai mwaaen epwe nigitiir noa seman me inan nge a noa rhuu ngaeni pwiuniuwan, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>nge iir me riiurhai repwene eew rhag. Ina minne iir resoapw rhiuwen riiurhai no, pwe ra erhai rhag. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Esooar erhai aeremas ne epwe mweoiti fesaenngiy meeta e Deus a oarhuw fengaenniy.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Igiwe ra teeo sefaaen nong noan iimw we, rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra aeiineow Jesus faaen kkepas kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Erhai mwaaen e mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan, nge a noa pwiuniuwaeni pwan erhai rhooapwut, iya monofit ngaeni pwiuniuwan. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Epwan aeffitaeg rhag aere erhai rhooapwut e mweoiti aan appwiuniupai nge a noa pwan pwiuniuwaeni pwan erhai mwaaen, iya monofit ngaeni mwaaen we pwiuniuwan.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Maeipinaar Wonigaet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luke 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigito naiiur wonigaet reen Jesus pwe epwe iseni tae paiun wooar, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra soong ngaeniir. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Igiwe Jesus a weri meeta we ra feeori, a igin soong iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Fangeto aetekkena reei, nge oawsoapw aiugiiur, pwe minna Mweoiun Deus ina aar aeremas kka reweer wonigaet. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe iyo na ese aetiwa Mweoiun Deus taeppen erhai wonigaet, nge esoapw mmwenen toonong noan.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Iwe a roamito aetekkewe noan paiun, a iseni tae paiun wooan erhai me erhai iir, nge a maeipinaar.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erhai Mwaaen Naiwiis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luke 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Igiwe Jesus a pwan rhaepiy aan faaeraeg, erhai mwaaen a fattapweto reen, a foatotiw me mmwan nge a tingoareei pwe, “Sinsei mwamwaai, meeta ipwe feeori nge epwe yo ngaeniaei menaw na esooar iaenin?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Meeta wo iura pwe i mwamwaai reen? Esooar erhai ne e mwamwaai pwe aeggaen Deus rhag. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Wo giuneei anniug kkewe: ‘Wosoapw nni aeremas, wosoapw ffeeor manetemwaai, wosoapw mwoarho, wosoapw oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan erhai, wosoapw riugiuriug, wopwe aesirowuur semoamw me inoamw.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Mwaaen we a iura pwe, “Sinsei, saengi rhag nee nipwaen wonigaeteei nge ngaang i tapweei oanongaen anniug kkeei.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Jesus a aenneta wenewenei noan aerhaengerhaeng nge a aengaeni pwe, “Eew rhag minne wopwe feeori. Wonoa ameow noa oanongaen meeta oamw nge wa fang senaapian ngaeniir rhooa affayeo, nge epwe yor wiinoamw me wooan naaeng. Iwe nge wa itto tapweaei.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Igiwe mwaaen we e rongorong kkepas kkewe, a mas affayeo noa, iwe a siunoa noan aan tip aenneew, pwe igiwe iiy erhai man naiwiis.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Jesus a wegitaeg fetaen neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Epwe ifa mwo waeiraesin aar rhooakka re pisaegisaeg repwe toonong noan Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra riutae reen kkepas kkewe, nge Jesus a soapwei noa aan iura pwe, “Aaemi naeyi, epwe ifa mwo waeiraesin toonongon noan Mweoiun Deus! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Egin mererhaeg aaen erhai <char style="tl">camel</char> epwe toonong noan ngetaen efoarh oaguwa, me mmwaen aaen erhai mwaaen pisaegisaeg epwe toonong noan minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Reen minneen nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra igin riutae reen iwe ra aeiineo fengaen wooar pwe, “Iwe, iyo rhag epwe mmwenen menaw?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Jesus a fan wenewen ngaeniir nge a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Minneen nge ese mmwen ngaeniir aeremas nge emmwen ngaeni Deus; pwe oanongaen meeta nge emmwen ngaeni.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Peter a kkepas tae pwe, “Pipiiy, aemaem aeiya siusaengi oanongaen aegiaeg nge aeiya itto tapweog.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe iyo e siusaengi imwan, aere pwiin, aere mwengeyan, aere inan, aere seman, aere naiun, aere faniuwan faaen itaei me Kkepas Mwamwaai we, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>nge epwe pwigi faeregitin reen oate igina. Epwe pwigi meoniun epwe temoag saengi epwiugiuw imwan, pwiin, mwengeyan, inan, naiun me faniuwan, pwan niniy aenneewa; nge noan oatona epwe itto epwe pwan pwigi menaw na esooar iaenin. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Pwe towunepeer rhooawe re amwirimwir repwene gommw, nge towunepeer rhooawe regommw repwene amwirimwir.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aeinuwaen Aaen Jesus Aepesa Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luke 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra faaeraeg wooan aan we enoa ngaeni Jerusalem. Jesus a gommwonoa memmweer rhooan kkayeo kkewe, iwe nge iir ra riutae; nge ikkiwe re tapweto mwirin nge ra mesag. Jesus a pwan paeniir rhooawe seig me riiurhai rhooan kkayeo nge a aengaeniir wunuunun meeta kka epwene wen ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening, sipwene faaeraeg tae Jerusalem nge mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwene noa yonong nee paiiur soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe. Repwene apwiungiu pwe epwe maenoa, nge ra fangenoa nee paiiur Gentiles, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>nge repwene aeni aegekkaei nge re oattuffa, repwe wirhiy nge reniiy noa; nge mwirin enuuw raaen nge epwe menaw sefaaen tae.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar James me John Tingoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Iwe James me John, naiun Zebedee, ra itto reen Jesus. Ra aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, eyor meeta aei mwerhaen wopwe feeori ngaenigemaem.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta naan?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Oate wa mooat wooan cchia na oamw noan minna Mweoiumw, aei tipaeni pwe wopwe oamooatagemaem oaromw, erhai peig mwaaenemw, nge erhai peig rhooapwutomw.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi oawse giuneei meeta mwu oawwa tingoar. Oawmmwenen iun me reen kkepaen aewwaeiraes e ngaang ipwe iuniumi? Emmwen oawpwe paptismus noan taeppen paptismus e ngaang ipwe aeni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Iir ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa, emmwen ngaenigemaem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawmmwenen iun me reen kkap e ngaang ipwe iuniumi, me oawpwan mmwenen paptismus taeppen aaei paptismus. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Nge saapw ngaang minne ipwe finitae iyo epwe mooat peig mwaaeneei me peig rhooapwutoi. Neniy kkeei nge nenieer rhooakkena minna Semaei a fasiun feeori pwe nenieer.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra igin soong wooar James me John. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Iwe Jesus a faingi fengaenniir nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw giuneei pwe rhooakka refeeoriir pwe re nemaeniir re Gentiles ina eyor maemaeweer wooar aeremas, iwe nge iir soamwoon kaan ina re nemaeniir noa oanongeer aeremas. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Nge esoapw ieei wunuunun nee finaemi. Pwe iyo a mwerhaen taegias me neeimi, iiy epwe no pwe rhooan engaang ngaenigaemi oanongaemi; <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>nge iyo a mwerhaen pwe epwe gommw me neeimi, iiy epwe <char style="tl">slave</char> ngaenigaemi oanongaemi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Pwe miniwe Naiun Aeremas mwo nge ese itto pwe aeremas repwe engaang ngaeni, pwe efaer itto pwe epwe engaang ngaeniir aeremas me fangenoa menewan faaen iteer towunepaen aeremas.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aeffeta Noa Mesaen Bartimaeus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luke 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Ra toori Jericho, nge Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun me mwirhaen aeremas kkewe ra mwet saengi igiwe, nge erhai mwaaen parh mesan itan Bartimaeus naiun Timaeus, emooat wenepeigin aan pwe e tingoar noa rhag aemmwenen. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Igiwe a rongorong pwe Jesus re Nazareth we a itto, a rhaepetae ne iyaekkepwas, “Jesus, Naiun David, faayeowaei!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Towunepeer aeremas kkewe ra soong ngaeni nge ra aengaeni pwe epwe anniug noa. Nge egius mwo nge oatomoga noa aan iyaekkepwas, “Naiun David, faayeowaei!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Jesus a iug noa nge a iura pwe, “Oaw faingito.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Iwe ra faingi mwaaen we eparh nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Aemenetoag! Iutae pwe Jesus a faingiug.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Iwe a pwinititiw mengaagiun niugiun we, a nnustae nge enoa reen Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Meeta wo tipaeni ipwe feeori ngaeniug?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Iwe mwaaen we eparh a paniuwaeni pwe, “Sinsei, ngaang i tipaeni ipwe weriwer sefaaen.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Wonoa, pwe oamw niugiuniug a aecchipwoag.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Iwe rhag nge mwaaen we a ffatenoa mesan nge a tapweei noa mwirin Jesus wooan aan we.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Toonongon Jesus Noan Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">John 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Igiwe ra aerepato Jerusalem, oaron aepinoamw kkewe Bethphage me Bethany, reen rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>. Jesus a fangenoa riiurhai rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa noan pwugos mwu mmwaemi. Nge igine oawpwe toonong, nge oawpwe weri erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char> mwittig e feotaeg ina esaaen yor mwo erhai ne e waawa. Oaw pwaeisi oawwa pwigito igeei. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Nge aere eyor ne e aeiyegigaemi aere meeta oawfeeori minna reen, oaw aengaeni pwe Soamwoon e mwerhaen waawa mwo nge ennaen aesefaaenito.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Iwe ra noa nge ra noa weri erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char> mwittig e iu wooan ennap, nge e feotaeg ngaeni iuraen aesemaen eew iimw. Nge igiwe re pweppwaeisi, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>nge aaemweoi aeremas kkewe reno igiwe ra aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta mwu oawfeeori imwu oawwa pwaeisi noa <char style="tl">donkey</char> na?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Iir ra paniuwaeniir taeppen rhag ititin kkepas kkewe Jesus e aengaeniir, iwe aeremas kkewe ra nigitiir noa. <figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00315B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="11.6-10"/> <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Ra pwigito <char style="tl">donkey</char> we reen Jesus nge ra iseni tae mengaagiiur wooan, nge Jesus a teeotae wooan. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Aeremas towunap kkewe ra mmeraeg tiw mengaagiiur wooan aan we, nge aaemweoi ra gopogop tiw paeiniu me wooan aar maat pwe enenaen wooan aan we. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Aeremas kkewe regommw me rhooawe re tapweto mwirin ra aekkepwas, “Aepingepinga Deus! Deus epwe aewenepwuwa aeremas na epwe itto faaen itaen Soamwoon! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Deus epwe aewenepwuwa minna mweoiun <char style="tl">king</char> David, na semarh ina epwene itto. Aepingepinga Deus na oarosaen taegias!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Igiwe Jesus a toorito Jerusalem nge a toonong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge a fanefetaen reen oanongaen meeta. Nge pwonno igiwe a mwirin oanowas iwe a noa Bethany iiy me rhooan kkewe seig me riiurhai.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Soong Ngaeni <char style="tl">Fig</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Mmasetaen raaenin we eew, igiwe ra sefaaen to me Bethany, nge Jesus a pecchai. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>A wori noa me itaaw efoarh waniwan we <char style="tl">fig</char> pwe a pwanipwan noa faaen rheon, iwe a faaeraeg ngaeni pwe epwe pipiiy aere e uwa. Nge igiwe a toori <char style="tl">fig</char> we, a weri pwe rheon rhag, pwe esaaen toori mwo oaton aan epwe uwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Jesus a kkepas ngaeni <char style="tl">fig</char> we pwe, “Esooar erhai ne epwe rhiuwen mwongo uwoamw.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun re rongorong minikkewe mwaenian.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luke 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">John 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Igiwe ra toorito Jerusalem, Jesus a toonong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge a rhaepetae aan asiiur wow rhooawe re chuwaai me ameomeo pisaeg me igiwe. A aerheppa noa <char style="tl">table</char> kkewe aar rhooan ssiuwen senaapiy me nenien mooat kkewe aar rhooan chuwaai <char style="tl">pigeons</char>, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>ese fang ngaeni mwo nge erhai epwe pweipwog fetaen aegiaeg noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Iwe a fenaiiur aeremas kkewe pwe: “E foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus pwe Deus e aepesa pwe, ‘<char style="tl">Temple</char> e aaei nge epwe ffai pwe imwaen maeipin faaen iteer oanongeer aeremesaen faniuw.’ Nge aaemi oawwa ssiuweniy ngaeni eew nenien wopoor rhooa mwoarho.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Igiwe soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, a rhaepetae aar giutta meeta repwe niiy noa Jesus reen. Nge iir re mesagiu, pwe igiwe pwuwaen aeremas kkewe remwaar reen aan fenai.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Igiwe a nee oatofaaef noa, Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra siusaengi aepinoamw we.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiun Aemmetefaen <char style="tl">Fig</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Nee oatosoraen raaenin we eraaen, igiwe ra faaeraeg noa wooan aan we, ra weri <char style="tl">fig</char> we. A ppwass noa oanongaen waniwan we tooritiw minikkewe waeran. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Peter a maengiy miniwe a wen iwe a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, pipiiy, <char style="tl">fig</char> we wosoong ngaeni ina a ppwass noa.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe niugiuniug ngaeni Deus. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe aere erhai epwe aengaeni rhug een pwe, ‘Wopwe mwagiut wa noa oatoranoa oanongoamw nee metaw,’ nge ese tip mwaramwar noan pwunnon, pwe e niugiuniug pwe meeta rhag e aepesa pwe epwe wen, ina nge epwe mmwen ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Ina faan minne ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe: Ngaere oaw maeipin nge oawwa tingoar eew meeta, oaw niugiuw pwe oawwa pwigi, ina nge epwe toorigaemi ese tiwegin meeta oaw tingoar. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Ngaere oaw iun maeipin, oaw saeneti oanongaen soong kena aaemi wooan erhai, pwe ina nge Semaemi wooai naaeng epwe pwan saeneti noa oanongaen meeta mini aenneew kka aaemi oawpwan feeori. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>[Ngaere oawse saenetiir noa aaemweoi, Semaemi wooai naaeng esoapw pwan saeneti noa mini aenneew kena oawpwan feeori.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Nemaeniaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luke 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Iwe ra pwan sefaaen to Jerusalem. Nge igiwe Jesus a faaeraeg fetaen noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug me mwaaen kkewe aar ra itto reen <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta nemaenioamw pwe wopwe feeori minikkeei? Iyo a ngaenneog oamw nemenem?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ngaang ipwe aeiineogaemi eew kkepas aeiineo, nge aere oawpwe aengaeniaei paniuwaen, ngaang ipwe pwan aengaenigaemi iya iga i pwigi aaei nemenem me ee pwe ipwe feeori minikkeei. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Oaw aengaeniaei iya e itto aaen John nemenem pwe epwe paptismus fetaen: saengi Deus aere saengi aeremas?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Ra rhaepetae aar aengimaw fengaen wooar: “Meeta sipwe iura? Aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi Deus,’ nge iiy epwe aeiineogirh pwe, ‘Nge meeta rhag oawse niugiuniug ngaeni John reen?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Nge aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi aeremas…’ ” (Re mesagiiur aeremas, pwe igiwe oanongeer nge re niugiuw pwe John nge ennetaen erhai profeta.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Iwe ra paniuwaeni Jesus pwe, “Aeise giuneei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iwe ngaang isoapw pwan aengaenigaemi iya iga i pwigi me ee nemaeniaei pwe ipwe feeori minikkeei.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Aemmwenen Maat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luke 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Iwe Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir noan fioangon awewe: “Eno erhai mwaaen a foatogi eew maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char>, a feeori gurun niugiun, a genengi eew niipw pwe nenien wongowongin uwaen <char style="tl">grape</char>, iwe a aiuwtae eew imwaen poos taegias me noan. Mwirin a ngaenneer aaemweoi rhooan maat pwe repwe aefaenniy. Iwe rhag nge a saei taaw noa. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Nge igiwe a toori oaton gin, a fangenoa erhai rhooan akkiuneo reer rhooan maat kkewe, pwe epwe noa pwigi wiwiin me reen uwaen maat we. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Iwe rhooan maat ra torofi rhooan akkiuneo we, ra wirhiy nge ra aefengafeta noa, esooar meeta e pwigi. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Mwirin wonowe aan maat we a fangenoa pwan erhai naiun rhooan akkiuneo; iwe rhooan maat kkewe ra wirhiy rhimwen nge ra feeori ngaeni aekkaew wegitaeg aessaew. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Iwe wonowe a pwan fangenoa erhai rhooan akkiuneo, nge iir ra niiy noa. Nge pwan ina rhag minne refeeori ngaeniir rhooa kkewe aaemweoi, aaemweoi ra wirhiir, aaemweoi ra niir noa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Iwe nge a noa notiw erhai, iwe sipegin naiun mwaaen aecchaeng. Oarosan nge a fangenoa mwaaen we sipegin naiun, nge a iura pwe, ‘I niugiuw, nge repwe aesirowu mwaaen e naeyi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Nge rhooan maat kkewe ra iura fengaenniy wooar pwe, ‘Ieei mwaaen we naiun mwaaen we aan maat eei iwe epwe pwugusaeni minneei. Oaw itto sipwe niiy noa, pwe sipwe pwigi minne pwugusaen pwe pwugusarh!.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Iwe ra torofi mwaaen we naiun, ra niiy noa nge ra oatorawow niugiun maat we.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Iwe Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta mwaaen we aan maat we epwene feeori? Epwene itto nge a niir noa rhooawe, nge a ngaenneer aaemweoi maat we. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Oawsaaen aeraegi mwo kkepas e noan Pwapwior we e Santus?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Fai we rhooan kaiu iimw re aerheei noa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">nge faer ina fai we egin yor ipitan me mmwaen oanongan.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Minneen nge feeoriaen Soamwoon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">a inamwo amwaraeran nningen!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Iwe, rhooawe soamwooniir Jews aetae repwe torofi Jesus, pwe igiwe re giuneei pwe fioangoor miniwe a aengaeniir. Nge ra mesag reer rhooa towunap we iwe ra nigiti Jesus iwe ra noa.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon <char style="tl">Tax</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luke 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Iwe ra fangenoa aaemweoi Pharisees me aaemweoi rhinaen Erotes, pwe repwe oatupwu Jesus noan aan kkepas. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Iwe, ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, aemaem aei giuneei pwe e wenewen oamw kkepas, nge wose niuwaennei minikka aeremas ra aeni niunniuwaen. Wose aefaenniy wunuunun erhai me erhai, nge wa fenaiuw wenewenen nee tipaen Deus ngaeniir aeremas. Aengaenigemaem, e mwamwaai aarh sipwe fang <char style="tl">tax</char> ngaeni Soamwoonin Rome, aere aapw? Ifa wusun, sipwe fang <char style="tl">tax</char> aere aapw?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Nge Jesus a giuneei wunuunun aar niunniuwaen iwe a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Meeta menaen oawpwe soatoniaei reen? Oaw pwigito efai senaapiy <char style="tl">silver</char>, pwe ipwe pipiiy.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Iwe ra pwigito efai senaapiy reen nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Mesaen iyo me itaen iyo een?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Iir ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoonin Rome.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iwe nge oaw ngaenneei Soamwoonin Rome meeta aaen Soamwoonin Rome, nge oaw ngaenneei Deus meeta aaen Deus.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Iwe ra igin mwaar noa reen.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luke 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Aaemweoi Sadducees kkewe, iwe re aepesa pwe esooar menaw sefaaen me reen mae, ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aengaeni pwe, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Sinsei, Moses minne e foatogi anniug eei pwe aemaem: ‘Aere erhai mwaaen a mae nge esooar naiun wooan rhooapwut we pwiuniuwan, ina nge mwaaen we pwiin epwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we pwe epwe yor naiun pwe epwe ffai pwe naiun mwaaen we a mae.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Reno fiusiuman pwipwi. Iwe mwaaen we e tugufaeyi a pwiuniuwaeni erhai rhooapwut, nge a maenoa nge esaaen yor naiun. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Mwirin iwe ariiurhaiun a pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we, iwe a pwan maenoa nge ese pwan yor naiun. Ieei rhag taeppen minne epwan wen ngaeni iwe aeiniurhaiun, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>pwan ina rhag miniwe ewen ngaeniir oanongeer noa: Rhooawe fiusiuman re pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we nge ra pwan maenoa oanongeer nge esooar naiiur wooan niewe. Mwirin noan, nge rhooapwut we a maenoa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Igina, noan raaenin na manimae repwene menaw sefaaen, iyo me neeiir epwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we? Pwe igiwe rhooawe fiusiuman nge re pwiuniuwaeni niewe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Aaemi oaw mwaerhei me igeei! Nge oaw giuneei faaen? Pwe iga oawse giuneei Pwapwior we e Santus aere aaen Deus mamaaw. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Pwe oate rhooa mae repwe menaw sefaaen, nge repwene aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhag angkenusun naaeng, pwe resoapw pwiuppwiuniuw no. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Igina, reen manimae aar repwe menaw sefaaen: oawsaaen aeraegi mwo me noan Pwapwior kkewe foatogiaen Moses wunuunun waniwan we e ppwunuwow aengaet me noan? Iginaan minne e foatogi me ee aaen Deus aengaeni Moses pwe, ‘Ngaang aaen Abraham Deus, aaen Isaac Deus me aaen Jacob Deus.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Iiy aar Deus rhooawe re menaw, nge saapw aar rhooawe ra maenoa. Aaemi oawwa igin mwaerhei me igeei.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anniug we Oarosaen Taegias</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luke 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Erhai sinsein anniug eno igiwe nge e rongorong meeta kkewe re iyaekkepesa. E giuneei pwe egacch paniuwaen kkepas aeiineo we aar me reen Jesus, iwe a itto reen pwe epwe aeiineow: “Ifa anniug e oarosaen taegias meneiin oanongaen?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ieen minne oarosaen taegias me neeiin, ‘Wopwe aiussaening Israel! Soamwoon na aarh Deus ina iiy rhag minne aarh Soamwoon. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Wopwe aerhaengi Soamwoon na oamw Deus reen oanongaen nee tipoamw, reen oanongaen ngeoniumw, reen oanongaen oamw niunniuwaen pwan reen oanongaen maemaewoamw.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Nge oaruwowwaen anniug epwan igin taegias nge, ‘Wopwe aerhaengiir rhooan weni oaromw taeppen rhag oamw sipegin aerhaengi oanongoamw.’ Esooar eew anniug e e taegias saengi ikka ruwowu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Sinsein anniug we a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “E mwamwaai, sinsei! Egin nnet meeta mwu wa faer aepesa, pwe Soamwoon rhag minne Deus, nge esooar erhai Deus me peig noan. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Nge een wopwe aerhaengi Deus reen oanongaen nee tipoamw, reen oanongaen oamw niunniuwaennen me oanongaen maemaewoamw, me wopwe pwan aerhaengi rhooan weni oaromw taeppen rhag oamw sipegin aerhaengi oanongoamw. E igin yor ipitan aaen erhai epwe aiussaening firhiy anniug kka ruwowu, mmwaen aan epwe aeni oasoar maan wooan antar me mesemesaen oasoar ngaeni Deus.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Jesus e meyaefi gacchiun paniuwaenin kkepas kkewe aan, iwe a aengaeni pwe, “Een wose taaw saengi miniwe Mweoiun Deus.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Mwirin nge ra mesag repwe rhiuwen kkepas aeiineo ngaeni Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Iyo na Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luke 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Igiwe Jesus e fenai noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, a aeiineo eew kkepas, “Epwe ifa wusun nge sinsein anniug kkewe repwe aepesa pwe Kristus nge iiy teoteeon David? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Espritu Santus minne e aemeyaefi ngaeni David pwe epwe aepesa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Soamwoon a aengaeniaei Soamwoon:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Mooat tiw peig mwaaeneei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">toori aaei ipwe iseniir tiw rhooan oapwutoag faaen pirhemw.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>David wooan oanongan e sipegin faingi Kristus pwe iiy ‘Soamwoon’, iwe epwe ifa wusun nge Kristus epwe no pwe teoteeon David?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Jesus a Atapeonneogiiur Reer Sinsein Anniug Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luke 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ekker tipeer aeremas towunap kkewe re aiussaening ngaeni aaen Jesus fenai. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Igiwe e fenaiuw ngaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe aefaennigaemi reer sinsein anniug kkewe re aerhaengi aar faaeraeg fetaen faaen mengaagiiur min enaenaei, nge re aerhaengi aar aeremas repwe aewenimmwaar me aesirowuur me noan imwaen chuwaai, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>nge re fini rhag neniy kkena nenieer rhooa taegias me noan wutteer Jews me pwiuneoi mwamwaai me noan gupwun. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Re oapwurhaar rhooapwut kka ra mae pwiuniuweer nge ra pirifa saengiir pwuguseer, nge re oangona ngaeni aeremas aar maeipin enaei. Iwe nge aegaeregaeriir ina epwene igin waeiraes!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Erhai Rhooapwut Maenigaech</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luke 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Igiwe Jesus emooat oaron nenien maenigaech we me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, a pippipiir aeremas kkewe re iseis nong aar maenigaech. Towunepeer aeremas kkewe re naiwiis re iseis nong towunepaen naiiur senaapiy; <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>nge erhai rhooapwut mwaenene pwe a mae pwiuniuwan a itto iseis nong riiufai manfaifai, ina epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni oawton efai checcha. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Jesus a faingiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe miniwe rhooapwut mwaenene we efang nge e temoag saengi aar oanongeer aeremas towunap kkewe. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Pwe oanongeer nge re iseni nong nusegin wiineer, nge rhooapwut een inamwo iga e igin affayeo nge a fangenoa oanongaen meeta eno reen — a fangenoa oanongaen minikka epwe menaw wooan.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Toaroponoan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luke 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a siusaengi <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, erhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun a iura pwe, “Sinsei, pipiiy nningen faai me iimw kaan!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Woweri iimw faeregit kaan? Esooar efai faai kaan ne epwe notiw nenien; oanongan noa nge repwene toaropotiw.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Affayeo me Aewwaeiraes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luke 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Jesus emooat wooan miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char> peiginoan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, igiwe Peter, James, John me Andrew renoa reen nge iir noa rhag. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>Ra aeiineow pwe, “Aengaenigemaem ineeta minikkeei epwe wen, me aengaenigemaem meeta minne epwe pwaeri noa pwe oaton minikkeei nge epwene wen.”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aefaennigaemi, pwe esoapw yor erhai epwe oatupwugaemi. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Towunepeer aeremas repwene itto faaen itaei nge repwe aepesa pwe, ‘Ngaang iiy!’ Iwe nge pwuwaen aeremas repwe tupw noa reer. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Oawsoapw mesag igine oaw rongorong oacchorongon moawun arapeto aere kkepesaen moawun taaw noa. Oanongaen minikkeei nge repwe mmwaen wen, nge saapw reen a arapeto ne soapwonoan. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Faniuw me faniuw repwe fiiow fengaen nge mweoi me mweoi repwe pwan moawun fengaen. Epwe yor fanemwar oanongaen pwiuneoi me naengeta. Minikkaan nge eweei pweoneotaen metaegin erhai rhooapwut iga epwe nainai.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Aaemi wooan oanongaemi oawpwe sipegin aefaennigaemi. Repwe torofigaemi nge re pwigigaemi nong noan nenien apwiung. Repwe wirhigaemi me noan wutteer Jews; oawpwe iutae mmweer soamwoonin anniug me <char style="tl">king</char> kkewe faaen itaei, pwe oawpwe aengaeniir Kkepas Mwamwaai we. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Nge weni mmwaen epwe tooto minna nee soapwonoan, nge Kkepas Mwamwaai een epwe gommwaen fenai ngaeniir oanongeer aeremesaen feoniufan wunus. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Aere ra torofigaemi nge re isenigaemi nong noan nenien apwiung, oawsoapw pireiir reen meeta oawpwe aepesa; pwe oatona epwe noa toori oatonaan, nge oawpwe aepesa meeta na eno reemw. Pwe petenaen kkepas kena oaw aepesa nge saapw mwaeniaemi, pwe e itto me reen Espritu Santus. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Aeremas repwene afangmaei noa pwiir ngaeni maenoa, nge saam repwe pwan feeori taeppen minneen ngaeni naiiur. Nge naiiur repwene pwan appaniuwaeni semeer me ineer nge re fangenoa iir repwe noa niir noa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge repwene oapwutaegaemi faaen itaei. Nge iyo e aetemaegin toori nee soapwonoan nge epwe menaw.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Min Aemmesagsag</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luke 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Aaemi oawpwe weri eew Min Oarosaen Aemmesagsag epwe iu eew pwiuneoi saapw fasiun nenien. (Ngaeni rhooan aeraegraeg: metefaaegini minneen!) Iwe rhooawe reno Judea repwe fattapwetae weei rhug. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Erhai ne eno wooan wungaen iimw, esoapw teeotiw noan imwan pwe epwe ittiw pweipwog meeta me ee. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Nge erhai ne eno noan maat, esoapw sefaaen ngaeni imwan pwe epwe pweipwog mengaagiun. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Epwe ifa mwo aar affayeo rhooapwut pwoopwo me ikka re nayigit noan oaton naan! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Oawpwe maeipin ngaeni Deus pwe minikkeei nge esoapw wen noan oaton patapat. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Pwe waeiraesin noan raaenin kkewe epwe faer igin waeiraes saengi me mmwaen ikkiwe rhaepetaen igiwe Deus a feeori feoniufan toorito igina. Nge esoapw rhiuwen yor taeppen epwe rhiuwen itto. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Pwe Soamwoon a oamworhomworha nepaen raaen; ngaere ese feeori, nge esooar ne epwe menaw. Nge pwonno faaen iteer rhooawe a finiir tae a oamworhomworhanoa nepaen raaen.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Iwe ngaere erhai e aepesa ngaenigaemi pwe, ‘Pipiiy, ieei iiy Kristus!’ aere ‘Pipiiy, inaan iiy!’ oawsoapw niugiuniug ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Pwe aaemweoi aeremas repwene oatupwutupw pwe iir Kristus, aere erhai profeta, nge repwene feeori min amwaraar me manaman, pwe repwe oatupwu rhooawe Deus a finiir tae aere repwe mmwenen feeori. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Oawpwe aefaennigaemi! Ngaang iya pwaeri ngaenigaemi minikkeei mmwaen aar repwe wen.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itton Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luke 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Noan raaenin kkewe mwirin oaton waeiraes, aenet epwene rorhonoa, meram esoapw rhiuwen ttin, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>nge fiiu repwene ppiungiutiw me noan naaeng, nge minikkiwe maemaewaen noan naaeng repwene mwagiut saengi nenieer. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Iwe nge miniwe Naiun Aeremas epwene pwaeto me neeiin toapw reen maemaewan me nningen. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Epwene fangenoa angkenus reen oanongaen pwaeisiisin faeinaengiy pwe repwe ioni fengaenniy rhooawe Deus a finiir me reen esoapw feoniufan toori esoapw.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiun Waniwan e <char style="tl">Fig</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luke 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Oaw kapwiung saengi waniwan e <char style="tl">fig</char>. Oate minikkena raaen ra arawaraw me mechecchoar noa nge a pwiugiuw wow rheon, oawwa giuneei pwe a arapeto neraeg. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Epwan taeppen rhag, igine oawweri minikkeei pwe a wen, oawpwene giuneei pwe oatowe ina a arapeto, oamoannatae pwe epwene rhaep. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe oanongaen minikkeei nge epwe wen weni mmwaen iga aeremesaen igina repwe maenoa. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Naaeng me soanop repwe soapwonoa, nge aaei kkepas esoapw soapwonoa.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esooar Erhai e Giuneei Raaenin Aere Awa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Esooar erhai e giuneei raaenin aere awa na epwe wen minikkeei reen, angkenusun naaeng mwo nge resoapw giuneei, aere miniwe Naiun, pwe aaen Saam rhag. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Oaw mmas nge atapeonneogiugaemi, pwe oawse giuneei ineet oatona epwe itto noan. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Epwe taeppen rhag aaen erhai mwaaen saei saengi pwugusan nge a siusaengi naiun rhooan engaang pwe repwe nemaeni oanongaen, mwirin a fang ngaeni erhai me erhai aan engaang, nge a anneogiu ngaeni poosun asam we pwe epwe pippipiir. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Iwe ina minne oawpwe atapeonneogiugaemi reen, pwe oawse giuneei ineet mwaaen we imwan epwe war, aere epwe war nee oatofaaef, aere nugaenipwoong, aere weni mmwaei raaen, aere nee oatosor. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Aere epwe mwetekkaein itto, ese gacch aan epwe werigaemi pwe oaw maiur. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Meeta iya aengaenigaemi, iya pwan aengaeniir oanongeer: Oaw atapeonneogiugaemi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Aar Rhiu Aenneewa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luke 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">John 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Igina nge a no rhag ruwowu raaen mmwaen miniwe gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me gupwunon fenoawa we esooar <char style="tl">yeast</char> reen. Nge soamwooniir patere me sinsein anniug kkewe ra pwiungiuw noan mwoanomwoan wunuunun aar repwe torofi Jesus, pwe repwe noa niiy noa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Ra iura pwe, “Sisoapw feeori minneei oaton gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char> pwe aeremas rete aefitigogo tae.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooapwut we e Aepiti Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">John 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Jesus eno noan Bethany noan imwaen Simon, erhai mwaaen kaenepaai mwo igiwe. Oaton we Jesus a mwongo, erhai rhooapwut a toonong faaen eew neo effeeor saengi <char style="tl">alabaster</char> nge e oawut ngaeni neoningas e igin cchoaw paniuwan effeeor saengi eew irae itan <char style="tl">nard</char>. Rhooapwut we a ripiy neo we iwe a aeniatiw wooan rhimwen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Aaemweoi aeremas kkewe reno reer ra soong iwe ra kkepas fengaen nee fineer, “Meeta ipitan aan oasonopa noa neoningas naan? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Aere efaer chuwaiuw noa nge epwe nigiti eniupwiugiuw senaapiy we <char style="tl">silver</char> nge ra ngaenneer man affayeo!” Iwe iir ra igin aepesa aenneewa rhooapwut we.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw siusaengi rhooapwut na! Meeta oaw amwagiutiu reen? Egin mwamwaai minne a feeori ngaeniaei. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Pwe rhooa affayeo repwe fasiun yor reemi oanongaen oat, nge oatona rhag oaw tipaeni oawpwe tipaengiir iwe oawwa feeori. Nge ngaang isoapw no rhag reemi oanongaen oat. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>A feeori iugiugiun meeta a mmwen ngaeni; a aeniatiw neo we wooan oanongaei pwe epwe oamoann ngaeni oaton aaei nipwaenipw. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe ese tiwegin iga repwe fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai een me ee, nge minne nieei a feeori nge aeremas repwene fioangei pwe aemaengimaengin faaen itan.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas a Tipaeni Epwe Fangenoa Tinnimaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luke 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Iwe Judas Iscariot, erhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai, a noa reer soamwoonin patere kkewe faaen itaen aan epwene fangenoa tinnimaen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Ra igin kker reen meeta we a aengaeniir, nge ra ppwon ngaeni pwe repwe ngaenneei naiun senaapiy. Iwe Judas a giutta eew oaton ne egacch pwe epwe fang ngaeniir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Mwongo Mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we me Rhooan Kkayeo Kkewe Naiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luke 22.7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">John 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Noan aeyewaen raaenin gupwunon fenoawa we esooar <char style="tl">Yeast</char> reen, noan raaenin we ra niir noa <char style="tl">lambs</char> kkewe pwe mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya iga wo mwerhaen pwe aeipwe noa oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me ee?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Iwe Jesus a fangenoa riiurhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe noa noan aepinoamw na, nge oawpwe rhuungi erhai mwaaen e pwigi eew ruumen rhaan. Oawwa tapweei noa <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>noan iimw na epwe noa toonong noan, nge oawwa aengaeni mwaaen na imwan iimw naan pwe: ‘Sinsei e iura pwe: Ifa sengkin na rhooan kkayeo kena naeyi me ngaang aeipwe mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me ee?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Ina epwene pwaeri ngaenigaemi eew sengkin faeregit ina wooan tae, ina a fasiun moannotae noan, nge ina igina oawpwene noa oamoannatae me ee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa noan aepinoamw we, ra noa weri oanongaen meeta we Jesus e aengaeniir; iwe ra oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Igiwe a pwoongtiw, Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai ra itto.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00320B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="14.17-25"/> <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Igiwe remooat reen <char style="tl">table</char> we pwe re mwongo, Jesus a iura pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, erhai me neeimi epwene fangenoa tinnimaei, mwaaen naan nge e tapweaei reen mwongo igina.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe a aenneew noa nee tipeer reen kkepas kkewe, nge erhai me erhai a rhaepetae aan aeiineo ngaeni Jesus, “Saapw ngaang?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Epwe erhai me neeimi rhooamwu seig me riiurhai, iiy e tapweaei reen rhirinong anan fenoawa noan saepiy een. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Minna Naiun Aeremas epwe maenoa taeppen rhag meeta we Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa; nge epwe ifa mwo aenneewaen mwaaen na iiy e afangmaei noa mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas! Egacch rhag igine rese nainitiw mwaaen een!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Soamwoon Mwongoon Faaef</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Igiwe re rhiuwen mwongo, Jesus a pwigi fenoawa we, a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig, iwe a giniiy nge a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a iura pwe, “Oaw pwigi, pwe ieen minne oanongaei.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Mwirin a pwigi eew kkap, a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig, nge a fang ngaeniir; iwe oanongeer ra iun me reen. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Jesus a aepesa pwe, “Ieen minne cchaei epwe nipinoa pwe faaen iteer towunepeer aeremas, minne cchaei epwene no pwe tiweginin ppwon we aaen Deus ngaenigaemi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe isoapw rhiuwen iuniumi <char style="tl">wine</char> een toori raaenin na ipwe iuniumi <char style="tl">wine</char> na effeo me noan minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Mwirin ra aeni erheo keoniun aerhigerhig, nge ra toowow ngaeni miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Aaen Peter Iura pwe Ese Giuneei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luke 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">John 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oanongaemi nge oawpwe nigitiaei noa, pwe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Deus epwe niiy noa rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> we, nge <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe repwene toaropas fetaen.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Nge mwirin aaei menaw sefaaen, ipwe gommwonoa Galilee me mmwaemi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ngaang isoapw nigitiug noa, inamwo me oanongeer nge re nigitiug noa!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Jesus a aengaeni Peter pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaeniug, pwe nee pwongiy mmwaen aaen maniug we epwe keokkeok faaen ruwowu, nge epwe faaen enuuw oamw iura pwe wose giuneaei.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Peter a egius mwo nge e aengimaaw ngaeni, “Esooar faaen eew ipwe aepesa minna, inamwo aere ipwe tapweog reen maenoa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Nge oanongeer a pwan ina rhag meeta re iura.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Maeipin Noan Gethsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luke 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Iwe ra itto reen eew pwiuneoi itan Gethsemane, nge Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oawmooat igeei iga ngaang ipwe maeipin.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>A paeniir noa Peter, James me John. Waeiraes me nee tip cchoaw a itto reen, <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Waeiraesin noan minne nee tipaei egin temoag, arapakkaan rhag epwe niaei noa. Oawno igeei nge oawwa mmas.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>A sooar mwet saengiir egius, a oatoratiw nee ppweon nge a maeipin, aere emmwen pwe esoapw toonong noan oaton waeiraes. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Iwe a maeipin, “Saam, Semaei! Oanongaen meeta nge emmwen ngaeniug. Pwigi saengiaei kkepaen waeiraes een. Nge soapw minna ngaang i tipaeni, pwe minna een wo tipaeni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Iwe a sefaaen nge a rhuungiir rhooawe eoniurhai pwe ra maiur. Iwe a aengaeni Peter pwe, “Simon, wa maiur? Ese mmwen mwo nge wopwe mmas noan eew rhag awa? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Oaw mmas nge oawwa maeipin pwe oawte ppiungiunong noan sessoat. Ngeon a mwerhaen, nge oanong a apwangapwang.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>A pwan sefaaen noa maeipin nge epwan aeni rhag taeppen kkepas kkewe e aeni mmwan. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Iwe a sefaaenitiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe nge a pwan giuneer pwe ra pwan maiur; pwe ra igin cchoaw. Nge rese giuneei meeta repwe aengaeni.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Enoa aeinuwaen aan sefaaeneto, a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw rhiuwen maiur me aseoseo? A gacch nepan! Awa we ina a tooto! Pipiiy, miniwe Naiun Aeremas ina repwene fangenoa nee paiiur rhooa monofit. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Oaw rhimwitae, oaw sia noa. Pipiiy, ieei iiy mwaaen we e fangenoa menewaei!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar Torofi Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luke 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">John 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Jesus e rhiuwen kekkepas, nge Judas iwe erhai me neeiir rhooawe seig me riiurhai a war. Pwuwaen aeremas kkewe re tapweei faaen naiiur saeitan me soapwon irae. Nge re itto faaen iteer soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug me mwaaen kkewe aar. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Rhooan afangmaei noa we a fang aeginn ngaeniir pwuwa we: “Mwaaen na ipwe faeisongei ina mwaaen na oaw tipaeni. Oaw torofi nge oawwa paeninoa nge oawwa posuw.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Igiwe rhag Judas a tooto, a faaeraeg wenewen ngaeni Jesus nge a aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei!”, nge a faeisongei. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Iwe ra torofi Jesus nge ra ammwarhiu neogiuw. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Nge erhai me neeiir rhooawe re iu a waeitiwow naiun saeitan, nge a fena rhooan akkiuneo we naiun Soamwoonin Patere iwe gopiy noa eew saeningan. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Jesus a kkepas tae nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oawnoa itto faaen naimi saeitan me soapwon irae pwe oawpwe torofiaei, pwe iga aetae ngaang erhai man mwoarho? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Raaen me raaen nge ngaang ino reemi i fenai noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge aaemi oawse torofiaei. Nge ina nigiti pwe meeta we e foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus epwe nnet noa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Iwe rhag nge oanongeer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra siusaengi nge ra fattapw noa.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Erhai anian e memmengaag eew mini mmis, e tettapw noa mwirin Jesus. Igiwe ra menaen pwe repwe torofi, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>a fattapw noa wooan aan esooar mengaagiun, pwe a siusaengi tiw.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Weni Mmweer Soaw Kapwiung Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luke 22.54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">John 18.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Iwe ra paeninoa Jesus noan imwaen Soamwoonin Patere we. Iwe soamwoonin patere kkewe, me mwaaen kkewe aar me sinsein anniug ra mwiirh fengaen. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Peter e tapweei noa mwirin Jesus me taaw noa nge a noa toonong noan wororaen iimw we imwaen Soamwoonin Patere we. A mooat tiw reer rhooan poos kkewe nge a raengiy reen aengaet we. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Soamwooniir patere me oanongeer rhooan council kkewe re giutta meeta eew teren Jesus, pwe repwe niiy noa, nge esooar meeta ne reweri. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Towunap rhooa oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan Jesus, nge aar kkepesaen oatupwutupw nge ese aeffitaeg fengaen.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Aaemweoi mwaaen ra iutae nge ra oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan Jesus, nge ra iura pwe, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Aemaem aeiya rongorong aan aepesa pwe, ‘Ngaang ipwe fereei <char style="tl">Temple</char> eei feeorieer aeremas, nge mwirin enuuw raaen ipwe aiusefaaeniy tae pwan eew nge soapw feeorieer aeremas.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Pwan iir mwo nge ese aeffitaeg fengaen mwaenieer.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Soamwoonin Patere we a iutae memmweer oanongeer nge aeiineow Jesus, “Esooar minne wopwe paniuwaeni ngaeni kkepas kka mwaaen kaan ra tipi ngaeniug?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Nge Jesus a anniug noa rhag nge esooar no eew kkepas ne e iura. Iwe Soamwoonin Patere we a pwan aeiineo sefaaeniy, “Een minne Kristus, Naiun Deus na Esooar?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa ngaang. Aaemi oawpwene giuneei Naiun Aeremas epwene mooat mwaaenen firhin iwe e oarosaen Mamaaw nge epwe ittiw me weei naaeng wooan toapw.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Iwe Soamwoonin Patere we a fereeitiw mengaagiun nge a iura pwe, “Meeta si rhiuwen pwigiir to rhooan oatuttur reen? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Oawwa sipegin rongorong aan aepesa aenneewa Deus. Meeta aaemi mwerhaen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Oanongeer nge ra pwiungiuw pwe: iiy e monofit nge epwe mae noa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Aaemweoi me neeiir a rhaepetae aar oattuffa, nge re pwaniuw noa mesan nge re peosepa. “Iura iyo e peosepoag!” aar aepesa. Nge poos kkewe ra noa peosepa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Aepesa pwe Ese Giuneei Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luke 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">John 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Peter eno rhag noan wororaen iimw we nge erhai rhooapwut naiun Soamwoonin Patere we rhooan engaang a itto reen. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Igiwe a weri Peter pwe a raengiy oanongan, a fan wenewen ngaeni nge a iura pwe, “Een pwan rhoaniuwaen Jesus rhooan Nazareth we.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Nge iiy a iura pwe, “Aapw, ise giuneei aere metefaaegini meeta mwu wo aepesa,” iwe a toowow niugiun. Iwe rhag nge e keokkeok noa maniug we.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Rhooapwut we rhooan engaang a pwan weri sefaaeniy Peter me igiwe nge a pwan aepini ngaeniir rhooawe oaron pwe, “Iiy erhai rhoaniuwaar!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Nge Peter a pwan aepesa pwe ese nnet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ese ssiunaei noa mwo nge rhooawe oaron ra pwan aengaeni Peter pwe, “Ennet, een pwan erhai rhoaniuwaen mwaaen naan, pwe een pwan erhai re Galilee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Nge Peter a iura pwe, “Iya aekkepan pwe ngaang i aepesa minne ennet! Deus epwe apwiungiuwaei aere i oatupwutupw! Ise giuneei mwaaen mwu oaw iyaepesa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Iwe rhag nge a keokkeok maniug we oaruwowwan, nge Peter a maengiy meeta we Jesus e aengaeni, “Weni mmwaen epwe keokkeok maniug, nge een wopwe aepesa faaen enuuw pwe wose giuneaei.” Eppwoar tiw rhag nge esaeng.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Weni Mmwaen Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luke 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">John 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Nee oatosor moawugowug nge soamwooniir patere me mwaaen kkewe aar ra mwiirh fengaen me sinsein anniug me iir ikkiwe aaemweoi oawuton <char style="tl">Council</char> we re pwiungiuw meeta repwene feeori. Ra geoni Jesus nge ra noa fangenoa reen Pilate. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Iwe Pilate a aeiineow pwe, “Een minne aar <char style="tl">king</char> re Jews?” Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een minimwu wo aepesa.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Soamwooniir patere kkewe ra tipitae wooan Jesus towunepaen aegiaeg, <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>iwe Pilate a pwan aeiyegiy sefaaeniy pwe, “Wosoapw paniuwaeni? Wo rongorong oanongaen kkepesaen oatuttur kka ra tipi ngaeniug!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Jesus esa paniuwaeni no, nge Pilate a mwaar noa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Aettiweginiy Aaen Jesus Mae Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luke 23.13-25</ref>; John 18.39 — 19.16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Oanongaen raeg reen gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char>, Pilate egaen saeneti noa erhai rhooan kanepwus, iyo we aeremas re tingoar. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Noan oaton naan nge eno erhai mwaaen noan kanepwus itan Barabbas, eno neeiir aaemweoi rhooa aenneew iwe resooaw nni aeremas faei oaton moawun. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Igiwe aeremas towunap ra rhu fengaen, ra tingoar ngaeni Pilate pwe epwe feeori wunuunun minne a fasiun feoffeeori, <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>iwe Pilate a aeiineeor pwe, “Oaw mwerhaen pwe ipwe saeneti ngaenigaemi <char style="tl">king</char>aaen Jews een?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Pilate e giuneei pwe soamwooniir patere kkewe minne re fangenoa Jesus reen pwe epwe noa apwiung faaen itaen aar noanowo ngaeni.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Nge soamwooniir patere kkewe ra aetemaeginiy ngaeniir aeremas kkewe pwe repwe tingoareei Pilate, pwe epwe saeneti ngaeniir Barabbas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Iwe Pilate a pwan aeiineo sefaaen ngaeniir pwe, “Nge meeta ipwe feeori ngaeni aeremas e oaw faingi pwe <char style="tl">king</char>aaen Jews?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Ra iyaekkepwas temoag tae, “Kurusuw noa!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilate a pwan aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta taeppen wegitaeg aenneew e a feeori?” Nge iir ra pwan oatomoga aar iyaekkepwas pwe, “Kurusuw noa!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilate e tipaeni pwe epwe amwamwaaiuw nee tipeer aeremas kkewe, iwe a saeneti ngaeniir Barabbas, nge ra wirhiy Jesus nge a fangenoa pwe repwe noa kurusuw noa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sonotaw Kkewe ra Aeni Aegekkaei Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">John 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Sonotaw kkewe ra paeninoa Jesus noan wororaen iimw we imwaen <char style="tl">governor</char> nge ra faingiir to oanongeer sonotaw kkewe rhoaniuwaar. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Ra aememmengaagiu ngaeni erheo mengaag siungiurhoan, nge ra pwan fiti eew mwaer saengi irae towfanfan iwe ra ngaettae wooan rhimwen. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Iwe ra rhaepetae ne aesirowu: “Sirow woamw, Kingaen Jews!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Ra wirhiy rhimwen ngaeni efoarh irae, nge ra oattuffa, nge ra foatotiw nge ra aesirowu ngaeni. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Igiwe ra moann reen aar aeni aegekkaei, ra pwiniti saengi mengaag siungiurhoan we, nge ra aememmengaagiu ngaeni ikkiwe sipegin mengaagiun. Iwe ra paeninoa pwe repwene noa kurusuw noa.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Kurusuw Noa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luke 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">John 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Igiwe re faaeraeg noa wooan aan we, nge ra noa rhuungi erhai mwaaen itan Simon saengi Cyrene, e itto saengi eew soapw pwe epwe toonong noan taeninimw we, nge sonotaw kkewe ra aengimaw ngaeni pwe epwe aiufera kurus we aaen Jesus. (Simon semaen Alexander me Rufus.) <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Ra paeninoa Jesus reen eew pwiuneoi itan Golgotha, wewen nge “Nenien Peopeoi Rhimw.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Igaan iga ra itto aiuniu ngaeni Jesus eew <char style="tl">wine</char> e nofit fengaen me aekkaew saefei itan <char style="tl">myrrh</char>, nge ese mwerhaen iuniumi. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Ra kurusuw noa Jesus, nge ra inetiy mengaag kkewe wooar, nge re aekkaerh <char style="tl">dice</char> wooar ngaere iyo epwe pwigi ifa. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>A kiung tiwowu nee oatosor iga re kurusuw noa. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Foatofoaton minne ra tipi ngaeni e iura pwe: “Ieei Kingaen Jews.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Repwan kurusuw noa riiurhai rhooa mwoarho oaron Jesus, erhai peig mwaaenen, nge erhai peig rhooapwuton. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>[Ieei wunuunun pwe epwe pwaenoan miniwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura pwe, “Refeeori pwe iiy erhai aeremas aenneew.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Aeremas kkewe re faaeraeg noa me oaron Jesus re iurhiugi rhimweer nge re aepesa aenneewa Jesus, “Aa! Een miniwe wo iura pwe wopwe fereeitiw <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge wa aiusefaaeniy tae noan enuuw raaen! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Iwe teeotiw me wooan kurus na pwe wopwe aemenewoag!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Epwan ina rhag wunuunun soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug kkewe re aeni aegekkaei Jesus reen aar aepesa pwe, “A aemenewaar aaemweoi, nge ese mmwenen aemenewa oanongan! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Oawsa pipiiy Kristus een, iwe Kingaen Israel, aan epwe teeotiw saengi kurusuna igina, ina nge sipwe niugiuniug ngaeni!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Nge pwan rhooa kkewe re tapweei reen kurus repwan aessaewa Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maenoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luke 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">John 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Saengi nugunupaen oanowas nge oanongaen faniuw we a rorhappiung noa noan enuuw konook. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Igiwe a enuuw konook nge Jesus a iyaekkepwas temoag tae pwe, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?” faan nge, “Aaei Deus, aaei Deus, meeta wa nigitiaei noa reen?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Aaemweoi aeremas kkewe re iu oaron ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra iura pwe, “Oaw rongorong, a faingi Elijah!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Erhai me neeiir a fattapweto reen faaen eew faerewa, a rhirinong noan <char style="tl">wine</char> emwaenn, nge a iseni tae nee soapwon efoarh irae. A aeititae irae we ngaeni ewaen Jesus nge a iura pwe, “Weti sipwe pipiiy aere Elijah epwe itto ateeotiwei me wooan kurus na!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>E apwas temoag noa rhag faaen eew, nge a nurh noa aan ngasangas.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Mengaag we e tteoraeg noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we mwo nge e taeringatiw faaen ruwowu, saengi wooan ittiw faan. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Erhai soamwoonin sonotaw e iu mmwaen kurus we eweri wunuunun aaen Jesus maenoa, a iura pwe, “Ennetaen pwe mwaaen een nge Naiun Deus!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Aaemweoi rhooapwut reno igiwe, re oawruruto me itaaw. Neeiir rhooapwut kkewe nge Maria Magdalene, Maria we inaen James me Joseph iwe me pwan Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Re tapweei Jesus me noan Galilee reen aar tittipaengi. Towunepeer rhooapwut kkewe re tapweeito Jesus me Jerusalem repwan no igiwe.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paeyinoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luke 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">John 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43"/>A faaeraeg ngaeni nee oatofaaef nge Joseph re Arimathea we a tooto. Iiy erhai e regin oawoai me noan <char style="tl">Council</char> we, iwe e wewweti itton minna Mweoiun Deus. A raaenin Aenimowu miniwe (eew raaen mmwaen raaenin Sabbath), noan maemaewaen nee tipaen Joseph a itto reen Pilate a itto tingoar miniwe oanongaen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Nge Pilate a riutae igiwe e rongorong pwe Jesus a fasiun maenoa. A tengaeg soamwoonin sonotaw we nge a aeiineow aere a ssiunaei aaen Jesus maenoa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Mwirin aan rongorong meeta we sonotaw we e iura reen mmwenen Jesus, Pilate a aengaeni Joseph pwe epwe noa pwigi mini oanongaen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Joseph meoni erheo mengaag pwerh ffeo, a iseni tiw miniwe oanongan Jesus me wooan kurus we nge a tiugiumi ngaeni mengaag we, a oawnanong noan paeyi we ekken wow me neeiin faai. Iwe a oasoagopeniy to efai faai gin temoag reen aesemaen paeyi we. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Maria Magdalene me Maria we inaen Joseph re pipiiy nge ra giuneei iya re paeiaeni miniwe oanongaen Jesus ee.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen Jesus Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luke 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">John 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Mwirin raaenin Sabbath, nge Maria Magdalene, Maria we inaen James iwe me Salome ra chuwaai neoningas, pwe repwe noa aepiti miniwe oanongaen Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Weni mmwaei raaenin Sunday, oatowe aenet epwene teeotae, ra noa reen paeyi we. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4"/>Wooan aar faaeraeg noa, ra kkepas fengaen nee fineer, “Iyo epwe peniy ngaenigirh fai we mesaen paeyi we?” (Egin faeregit fai we.) Nge renoa fannoai paeyi we, ra giuneei pwe fai we a faer mwagiut saengi aesemaen paeyi we.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00329B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="16.4"/> <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Igiwe ra toonong noan paeyi we, ra weri erhai mwaaen anian emooat peig mwaaenen paeyi we, e memmengaag min pwerhepwerh, nge ra mesag reen.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw mesag. I giuneei pwe oaw giutta Jesus re Nazareth we re kurusuw noa. Esa nono igeei, a menaw sefaaen! Oaw pipiiy, igaan igiwe re oawnatiw ee. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Iwe oawnoa aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun me pwan Peter: ‘Iiy ina epwene gommw noa Galilee me mmwaemi; iginaan minne oawpwene noa weri me ee, taeppen rhag meeta we e aengaenigaemi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Iwe ra toowow nge ra fattapw saengi paeyi we, noan aar mesag me riu. Nge rese aepesa ngaeni mwo nge erhai, pwe ra igin mesag.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Soapwonoan Kkepas Mwamwaai we</para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwae Ngaeni Maria Magdalene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">John 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>[Mwirin aaen Jesus menaw sefaaen nee oatosoron raaenin Sunday we, egommwaen pwae ngaeni Maria Magdalene, iwe e oatowowuw fiusiuman aniu aenneew me reen. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Niewe a noa iwe a noa aengaeniir rhooawe rhinaan. Rhooawe re sessaeng reen aenneewaen nee tipeer; <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>nge igiwe ra rongorong pwe Jesus a menaw sefaaen pwe iiy a weri, nge rese niugiuniug ngaeni.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwae Ngaeniir Riiurhai Rhoaniuwan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luke 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Mwirin minneei nge Jesus a pwaenoan pwan eew taeppen wegitaeg ngaeniir riiurhai rhooan kkayeo kkewe igiwe re faaeraeg ngaeni aepinoamw we. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Ra sefaaen nge ra aengaeniir ikkiwe aaemweoi, nge iir rese niugiuniug reer.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwae Ngaeniir Rhooawe Seig me Erhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luke 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">John 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Feof 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Oarosan noa nge Jesus a pwae ngaeniir rhooawe seig me erhai igiwe iir re mwongo. A songetiir, pwe esooar aar niugiuniug, ra pwan tipoarorh, pwe rese niugiur rhooawe ra weri pwe Jesus a menaw sefaaen. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa wooan oanongaen faniuw oawpwe noa fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai een ngaeniir oanongeer aeremas. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Iyo e niugiuniug nge a paptismus nge epwe menaw, nge iyo ese niugiuniug nge epwe aegaeregaer. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Rhooakka re niugiuniug repwe fang maemaeweer pwe repwe feeori manaman: repwe asiiur aniu aenneew faaen itaei; nge repwe kkepesaen noa eew me eew faniuw, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>ngaere repwe pweipwog sowufaeng aere iun pwoisiun, nge resoapw woas; nge repwe iseni tae paiiur wooar rhooa semwaai nge repwe cchipw tae.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Ittae Naaeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luke 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Feof 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Mwirin aaen Soamwoon Jesus kkepas ngaeniir, a ittae naaeng a ittae mooat peig mwaaenen Deus. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa fenai wooan oanongaen pwiuneoi, nge Soamwoon e engaang neeiir nge e pwaeri noa aar fenai pwe ennet reen oanongaen manaman kkewe ra feeori.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.9-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:20">Pwan Eew Aigiugiun Kkepas Mwamwaai we</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:20">
    <char style="vp">9a</char> [Rhooapwut kkewe ra noa reen Peter me rhooawe rhinan ra noa fioangei ngaeniir oanongaen meeta kkewe re rongorong. <char style="vp">10a</char> Mwirin minneei nge Jesus wooan oanongan a fang wow rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe noa fenai fetaeneei saengi eotiw toori netow kkepas mwamwaai we kkepesaen menaw na esooar ssiaaenin.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.9a-10a </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenaen eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
